window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":15,"en":"Language, Linguistics & Translation","zh":"語言學與翻譯","items":[{"w":"linguistics","pos":"n.","def":"the scientific study of language","cn":"語言學","s":"My cousin decided to study ________ at university because she loves languages, and she wants to understand how children learn to speak.","zh":"我的表姊決定在大學念語言學，因為她熱愛語言，而且她想了解孩子是如何學會說話的。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A1","t":"語言學"},{"w":"linguist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who studies how languages work","cn":"語言學家","s":"The ________ recorded the old villagers telling stories, and she later used the recordings to describe the grammar of their language.","zh":"這位語言學家錄下了年長村民講故事的聲音，之後她用這些錄音來描述他們語言的文法。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A2","t":"語言學家"},{"w":"linguistic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with language","cn":"語言的","s":"Moving to Japan was a big ________ challenge for Tom, but he practised every day and could chat with neighbours after a year.","zh":"搬到日本對湯姆來說是一大語言上的挑戰，但他每天練習，一年後就能和鄰居聊天了。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A3","t":"語言上的"},{"w":"sociolinguistics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of how language and society affect each other","cn":"社會語言學","s":"In our ________ class we compared how teenagers and grandparents speak, and we found that each group uses very different words.","zh":"在我們的社會語言學課上，我們比較了青少年和祖父母說話的方式，結果發現每個族群使用的詞彙都非常不同。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A4","t":"社會語言學"},{"w":"psycholinguistics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of how the mind uses and understands language","cn":"心理語言學","s":"Researchers in ________ use eye-tracking cameras, because they want to know exactly how our brains process words while we read.","zh":"心理語言學的研究人員使用眼動追蹤攝影機，因為他們想確切知道我們閱讀時大腦是如何處理文字的。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A5","t":"心理語言學"},{"w":"phonetics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of speech sounds","cn":"語音學","s":"Our teacher studied ________ in college, so she can explain exactly where to put our tongue when we make the \"th\" sound.","zh":"我們的老師在大學學過語音學，所以她能確切解釋我們發「th」音時舌頭該放在哪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A6","t":"語音學"},{"w":"semantics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of the meaning of words and sentences","cn":"語意學","s":"\"Cheap\" and \"inexpensive\" seem to mean the same thing, but ________ shows us that one word can sound more negative than the other.","zh":"「cheap」和「inexpensive」看似意思相同，但語意學告訴我們其中一個字聽起來可能比另一個更負面。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A7","t":"語意學"},{"w":"pragmatics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of how context changes what we mean","cn":"語用學","s":"When my mum asks \"Is the door open?\", she usually wants me to close it, and ________ explains how we understand these hidden requests.","zh":"當我媽媽問「門開著嗎？」時，她通常是要我去關門，而語用學解釋了我們如何理解這些隱藏的請求。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A8","t":"語用學"},{"w":"corpus","pos":"n.","def":"a large collection of real texts used for language study","cn":"語料庫","s":"The dictionary team searched a huge ________ of newspapers and websites, so they could see how often people really use each word.","zh":"字典編輯團隊搜尋了一個由報紙和網站組成的龐大語料庫，以便了解人們實際上多常使用每個字。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A9","t":"語料庫"},{"w":"morpheme","pos":"n.","def":"the smallest part of a word that has meaning","cn":"詞素","s":"The word \"unhappy\" has two parts, and each ________ adds meaning, because \"un\" means \"not\" and \"happy\" means \"glad\".","zh":"「unhappy」這個字有兩個部分，而每個詞素都增加了意思，因為「un」表示「不」，「happy」表示「高興」。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A10","t":"詞素"},{"w":"phoneme","pos":"n.","def":"one of the smallest sound units in a language","cn":"音素","s":"English learners in Taiwan often mix up the sounds in \"light\" and \"right\", because each ________ does not exist separately in their first language.","zh":"台灣的英語學習者常常混淆「light」和「right」的發音，因為這兩個音素在他們的母語中並沒有分開存在。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A11","t":"音素"},{"w":"syllable","pos":"n.","def":"a part of a word with one vowel sound","cn":"音節","s":"The word \"banana\" has three ________, and English speakers usually put the strongest sound on the middle one.","zh":"「banana」這個字有三個音節，而說英語的人通常把最重的音放在中間那個上。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A12","t":"音節"},{"w":"prefix","pos":"n.","def":"letters added to the start of a word to change its meaning","cn":"字首","s":"If you add the ________ \"re\" to \"write\", you get \"rewrite\", and the new word means \"write again\".","zh":"如果你在「write」前面加上字首「re」，就會得到「rewrite」，而這個新字的意思是「再寫一次」。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A13","t":"字首"},{"w":"suffix","pos":"n.","def":"letters added to the end of a word","cn":"字尾","s":"The ________ \"ness\" turns adjectives into nouns, so \"kind\" becomes \"kindness\" and \"dark\" becomes \"darkness\".","zh":"字尾「ness」能把形容詞變成名詞，所以「kind」變成「kindness」，「dark」變成「darkness」。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A14","t":"字尾"},{"w":"affix","pos":"n.","def":"a prefix or a suffix","cn":"詞綴","s":"Learning one common ________ can help you guess hundreds of new words, because the same pieces appear again and again.","zh":"學會一個常見的詞綴能幫你猜出幾百個新字，因為同樣的部分會一再出現。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A15","t":"詞綴"},{"w":"word root","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the main part of a word that carries its basic meaning","cn":"字根","s":"The ______ ______ \"port\" means \"carry\", so once you know it, words like \"transport\" and \"export\" become much easier to remember.","zh":"字根「port」的意思是「攜帶」，所以一旦你知道它，像「transport」和「export」這樣的字就變得容易記多了。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A16","t":"字根"},{"w":"inflection","pos":"n.","def":"a change in a word's ending to show tense, number, etc.","cn":"字尾變化；詞形變化","s":"English adds an ________ like \"-s\" or \"-ed\" to many words, but Chinese verbs never change their form at all.","zh":"英文會在許多字後面加上像「-s」或「-ed」這樣的詞形變化，但中文的動詞完全不會改變形式。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A17","t":"詞形變化"},{"w":"compound word","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a word made from two or more words","cn":"複合字","s":"\"Toothbrush\" is a ______ ______ made from \"tooth\" and \"brush\", and German has even longer examples than English.","zh":"「toothbrush」是由「tooth」和「brush」組成的複合字，而德文的例子甚至比英文還要長。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A18","t":"複合字"},{"w":"word order","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the order in which words are arranged in a sentence","cn":"詞序；字序","s":"In English the ______ ______ is usually subject, verb, object, but in Japanese the verb normally comes at the end.","zh":"英文的詞序通常是主詞、動詞、受詞，但在日文中，動詞通常出現在句尾。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A19","t":"詞序"},{"w":"sentence structure","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way words are put together to form a sentence","cn":"句子結構","s":"My writing teacher told me to vary my ______ ______, because using only short simple sentences makes an essay sound boring.","zh":"我的寫作老師叫我變化句子結構，因為只用短的簡單句會讓文章聽起來很無聊。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A20","t":"句子結構"},{"w":"grammar","pos":"n.","def":"the rules for forming words and sentences","cn":"文法","s":"Many students hate learning ________ rules, but these rules help them write clearly and avoid confusing their readers.","zh":"許多學生討厭學文法規則，但這些規則能幫助他們寫得清楚，並避免讓讀者感到困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A21","t":"文法"},{"w":"grammatical","pos":"adj.","def":"following or connected with the rules of grammar","cn":"文法上的","s":"The essay had a few ________ mistakes, but the ideas were so interesting that the teacher still gave it a high score.","zh":"這篇文章有幾個文法上的錯誤，但內容想法非常有趣，所以老師還是給了高分。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A22","t":"文法上的"},{"w":"prescriptive","pos":"adj.","def":"telling people how they should use language","cn":"規範性的","s":"Old grammar books were very ________ and told readers never to end a sentence with a preposition, but modern writers often ignore that rule.","zh":"舊的文法書非常規範性，告訴讀者絕對不要用介系詞結束句子，但現代作家常常忽略這條規則。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A23","t":"規範性"},{"w":"ungrammatical","pos":"adj.","def":"not following the rules of grammar","cn":"不合文法的","s":"The sentence \"He go to school yesterday\" is ________, so the teacher circled it and asked the student to correct the verb.","zh":"「He go to school yesterday」這個句子是不合文法的，所以老師把它圈起來，要求學生改正動詞。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A24","t":"不合文法的"},{"w":"part of speech","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a word class such as noun, verb or adjective","cn":"詞性","s":"\"Light\" can be a noun, a verb or an adjective, so you must check the sentence to decide its ______ ______ ______.","zh":"「light」可以是名詞、動詞或形容詞，所以你必須查看句子才能決定它的詞性。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A25","t":"詞性"},{"w":"cognate","pos":"n.","def":"a word that has the same origin as a word in another language","cn":"同源字","s":"The English word \"night\" and the German word \"Nacht\" are ________, and that is why they look and sound so similar.","zh":"英文字「night」和德文字「Nacht」是同源字，這就是為什麼它們看起來、聽起來都那麼相似。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A26","t":"同源字"},{"w":"plural","pos":"n.","def":"the form of a word that means more than one","cn":"複數形","s":"Most English nouns add \"s\" to form the ________, but some, like \"child\" and \"mouse\", change in strange ways.","zh":"大多數英文名詞加「s」構成複數形，但有些字，像「child」和「mouse」，會以奇怪的方式改變。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A27","t":"複數形"},{"w":"singular","pos":"adj.","def":"showing only one person or thing","cn":"單數的","s":"\"News\" looks like a plural noun, but it is actually ________, so we say \"the news is good\" and not \"the news are good\".","zh":"「news」看起來像複數名詞，但它其實是單數的，所以我們說「the news is good」而不是「the news are good」。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A28","t":"單數的"},{"w":"passive voice","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sentence form where the subject receives the action","cn":"被動語態","s":"Science reports often use the ______ ______, so writers say \"the water was heated\" instead of \"we heated the water\".","zh":"科學報告常常使用被動語態，所以作者會說「水被加熱了」而不是「我們加熱了水」。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A29","t":"被動語態"},{"w":"conjugate","pos":"v.","def":"to list or change the forms of a verb","cn":"（動詞）變化詞形","s":"In Spanish class we had to ________ twenty verbs every week, and I often forgot the endings for \"we\" and \"they\".","zh":"在西班牙文課上，我們每週都必須變化二十個動詞的詞形，而我常常忘記「我們」和「他們」的字尾。","part":"A","sec":"Linguistics & Language Structure 語言學與語言結構","lab":"A30","t":"變化"},{"w":"accent","pos":"n.","def":"a way of pronouncing a language that shows where you are from","cn":"口音","s":"My new classmate has a strong Scottish ________, so at first I found him hard to understand, but now I enjoy listening to him.","zh":"我的新同學有很重的蘇格蘭口音，所以一開始我覺得他的話很難懂，但現在我很喜歡聽他說話。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A31","t":"口音"},{"w":"dialect","pos":"n.","def":"a form of a language spoken in one area or by one group","cn":"方言","s":"My grandparents speak a local ________ at home, while my parents usually speak Mandarin with me and my sister.","zh":"我的祖父母在家說當地的方言，而我的父母通常用國語和我及我妹妹說話。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A32","t":"方言"},{"w":"intonation","pos":"n.","def":"the rise and fall of the voice when speaking","cn":"語調","s":"If you say \"Really?\" with a rising ________, it sounds like a question, but a falling tone can make it sound bored.","zh":"如果你用上揚的語調說「Really?」，聽起來就像個問題，但下降的語調會讓它聽起來很無聊。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A33","t":"語調"},{"w":"vowel","pos":"n.","def":"a sound like a, e, i, o or u","cn":"母音","s":"English has many more ________ sounds than Japanese, so Japanese learners often find words like \"ship\" and \"sheep\" confusing.","zh":"英文的母音比日文多得多，所以日本學習者常常覺得像「ship」和「sheep」這樣的字很容易搞混。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A34","t":"母音"},{"w":"consonant","pos":"n.","def":"a speech sound that is not a vowel, like b, t or s","cn":"子音","s":"Some words begin with three ________ in a row, like \"street\" and \"spring\", and these clusters are hard for many learners to say.","zh":"有些字開頭連續有三個子音，像「street」和「spring」，而這些子音群對很多學習者來說很難發音。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A35","t":"子音"},{"w":"rhythm","pos":"n.","def":"a regular pattern of strong and weak sounds","cn":"節奏","s":"English has a bouncing ________ with strong and weak beats, so reading poems aloud is a good way to practise it.","zh":"英文有一種強弱拍交替的跳躍節奏，所以大聲朗讀詩是練習它的好方法。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A36","t":"節奏"},{"w":"pitch","pos":"n.","def":"how high or low a sound is","cn":"音高","s":"In Mandarin the ________ of your voice can change a word's meaning, so \"mā\" and \"mà\" are completely different words.","zh":"在中文裡，聲音的音高可以改變一個字的意思，所以「媽」和「罵」是完全不同的字。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A37","t":"音高"},{"w":"stutter","pos":"v.","def":"to repeat sounds because it is hard to speak smoothly","cn":"口吃；結巴","s":"He used to ________ when he felt nervous, but speech lessons gave him confidence, and now he hosts the school radio show.","zh":"他以前緊張時會結巴，但說話課程給了他信心，現在他主持學校的廣播節目。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A38","t":"結巴"},{"w":"mumble","pos":"v.","def":"to speak quietly and unclearly","cn":"含糊地說","s":"Please don't ________ during your presentation, because the students at the back of the hall need to hear every word.","zh":"請不要在報告時含糊地說話，因為禮堂後面的學生需要聽清楚每一個字。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A39","t":"含糊地說話"},{"w":"whisper","pos":"v.","def":"to speak very softly using your breath","cn":"低聲說；耳語","s":"We had to ________ in the library, but my friend kept laughing loudly, so the librarian asked us to leave.","zh":"我們在圖書館裡必須低聲說話，但我朋友一直大聲笑，所以圖書館員請我們離開。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A40","t":"低聲說話"},{"w":"pronounce","pos":"v.","def":"to make the sound of a word","cn":"發音","s":"Many people do not know how to ________ \"Wednesday\", because the first \"d\" is silent and the spelling looks very strange.","zh":"很多人不知道「Wednesday」怎麼發音，因為第一個「d」不發音，而且拼字看起來很奇怪。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A41","t":"發音"},{"w":"mispronounce","pos":"v.","def":"to say a word wrongly","cn":"發錯音","s":"The host ________ the singer's name twice, and the audience laughed, so he apologised and asked her to say it herself.","zh":"主持人把歌手的名字唸錯了兩次，觀眾都笑了，所以他道歉並請她自己說一次。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A42","t":"唸錯"},{"w":"vocal cords","pos":"n.phr.","def":"parts in your throat that make the sound of your voice","cn":"聲帶","s":"Singers rest their ______ ______ before a big concert, because shouting or talking too much can damage their voice.","zh":"歌手在大型演唱會前會讓聲帶休息，因為大叫或說太多話會傷害他們的嗓子。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A43","t":"聲帶"},{"w":"tongue twister","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a phrase that is difficult to say quickly","cn":"繞口令","s":"Our teacher starts each class with a ______ ______ like \"She sells seashells\", and we all laugh when we make mistakes.","zh":"我們老師每堂課都用一個像「She sells seashells」這樣的繞口令開始，而我們犯錯時大家都會大笑。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A44","t":"繞口令"},{"w":"lisp","pos":"n.","def":"a speech problem where \"s\" sounds like \"th\"","cn":"大舌頭（s 發成 th）","s":"The little boy had a ________, so \"sun\" sounded like \"thun\", but it disappeared after he got his new front teeth.","zh":"那個小男孩有大舌頭，所以「sun」聽起來像「thun」，但他長出新門牙後這個問題就消失了。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A45","t":"大舌頭"},{"w":"fluent","pos":"adj.","def":"able to speak a language easily and well","cn":"流利的","s":"Sara became ________ in French after living in Paris for two years, and now she works as a tour guide there.","zh":"莎拉在巴黎住了兩年後，法文變得流利，現在她在那裡當導遊。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A46","t":"流利"},{"w":"rhyme","pos":"v.","def":"to have the same ending sound","cn":"押韻","s":"Children's songs are easy to remember because the lines often ________, like \"cat\" and \"hat\" or \"star\" and \"far\".","zh":"兒歌很容易記住，因為歌詞常常押韻，像「cat」和「hat」或「star」和「far」。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A47","t":"押韻"},{"w":"silent letter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a letter that is written but not pronounced","cn":"不發音字母","s":"The \"k\" in \"knife\" is a ______ ______, so we say \"nife\", which often surprises young learners.","zh":"「knife」中的「k」是不發音字母，所以我們唸成「nife」，這常常讓年幼的學習者感到驚訝。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A48","t":"不發音字母"},{"w":"phonetic alphabet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a set of symbols that show speech sounds","cn":"音標","s":"Most good dictionaries show words in the international ______ ______, so you can check the pronunciation even without audio.","zh":"大多數好的字典會用國際音標標示單字，所以即使沒有音檔，你也能查到發音。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A49","t":"音標"},{"w":"native speaker","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who learned a language from birth","cn":"母語人士","s":"Talking with a ______ ______ helped me learn natural expressions, but I also learned a lot from other learners in my class.","zh":"和母語人士交談幫助我學到自然的說法，但我也從班上其他學習者身上學到很多。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A50","t":"母語人士"},{"w":"mother tongue","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the first language you learned as a child","cn":"母語","s":"Her ______ ______ is Hakka, but she also speaks Mandarin, English and a little Korean, so she often helps foreign tourists.","zh":"她的母語是客家話，但她也會說國語、英文和一點韓文，所以她常常幫助外國觀光客。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A51","t":"母語"},{"w":"second language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language you learn after your first one","cn":"第二語言","s":"English is a ______ ______ for millions of people in Asia, and many of them use it every day at work.","zh":"英文是亞洲數百萬人的第二語言，而且其中許多人每天在工作中使用它。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A52","t":"第二語言"},{"w":"monotone","pos":"n.","def":"a voice that stays on one level and sounds dull","cn":"單調的聲音","s":"The lecturer spoke in a ________ for the whole hour, so half the students fell asleep before he finished.","zh":"那位講師整整一小時都用單調的聲音說話，所以一半的學生在他講完前就睡著了。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A53","t":"單調的聲音"},{"w":"lip-reading","pos":"n.","def":"understanding speech by watching people's lips","cn":"讀唇","s":"My aunt cannot hear well, but she is very good at ________, so please look at her when you speak.","zh":"我阿姨聽力不好，但她很擅長讀唇，所以你說話時請看著她。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A54","t":"讀唇"},{"w":"speech therapist","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a professional who helps people speak more clearly","cn":"語言治療師","s":"The ______ ______ taught my brother some fun mouth exercises, and his speech became much clearer within a few months.","zh":"語言治療師教了我弟弟一些有趣的嘴部運動，而他的說話在幾個月內就清楚多了。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A55","t":"語言治療師"},{"w":"speech recognition","pos":"n.phr.","def":"technology that changes spoken words into text","cn":"語音辨識","s":"The ______ ______ on my phone works well in quiet rooms, but it often writes the wrong words on a noisy bus.","zh":"我手機上的語音辨識在安靜的房間裡運作良好，但在吵雜的公車上常常打出錯字。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A56","t":"語音辨識"},{"w":"aloud","pos":"adv.","def":"in a voice that others can hear","cn":"出聲地；大聲地","s":"Reading stories ________ to young children builds their vocabulary, and it also helps parents and kids feel closer.","zh":"為幼兒大聲朗讀故事能增加他們的詞彙量，而且也能讓父母和孩子感覺更親近。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A57","t":"大聲"},{"w":"audible","pos":"adj.","def":"loud enough to be heard","cn":"聽得見的","s":"The speaker's voice was barely ________ because the microphone was broken, so people at the back started to complain.","zh":"因為麥克風壞了，講者的聲音幾乎聽不太見，所以後面的人開始抱怨。","part":"A","sec":"Sounds, Speech & Accents 語音、口說與口音","lab":"A58","t":"聽不太見"},{"w":"synonym","pos":"n.","def":"a word with the same or a similar meaning","cn":"同義字","s":"\"Big\" is a ________ for \"large\", but writers often choose \"huge\" or \"enormous\" when they want a stronger effect.","zh":"「big」是「large」的同義字，但當作者想要更強的效果時，常會選擇「huge」或「enormous」。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A59","t":"同義字"},{"w":"antonym","pos":"n.","def":"a word with the opposite meaning","cn":"反義字","s":"The ________ of \"generous\" is \"mean\", and learning words in opposite pairs makes them easier to remember.","zh":"「generous」的反義字是「mean」，而以相反詞成對學習單字會讓它們更容易記住。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A60","t":"反義字"},{"w":"homophone","pos":"n.","def":"a word that sounds like another but has a different meaning","cn":"同音異義字","s":"\"Their\" and \"there\" are ________, so even native speakers sometimes mix them up when they type quickly.","zh":"「their」和「there」是同音異義字，所以即使是母語人士快速打字時有時也會搞混。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A61","t":"同音異義字"},{"w":"homonym","pos":"n.","def":"a word spelled and said the same as another but with a different meaning","cn":"同形同音異義字","s":"\"Bat\" is a ________, because it can mean an animal that flies at night or the stick used in baseball.","zh":"「bat」是一個同形同音異義字，因為它可以指晚上飛的動物，也可以指棒球用的球棒。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A62","t":"同形同音異義字"},{"w":"idiom","pos":"n.","def":"a group of words whose meaning is different from the single words","cn":"慣用語；成語","s":"\"It's raining cats and dogs\" is a famous ________, but you will never see real animals falling from the sky.","zh":"「It's raining cats and dogs」是一個很有名的慣用語，但你永遠不會看到真的動物從天上掉下來。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A63","t":"慣用語"},{"w":"idiomatic","pos":"adj.","def":"natural and typical of native speakers","cn":"道地的；慣用的","s":"Watching TV series helped Kevin learn ________ English, so his speaking now sounds much less like a textbook.","zh":"看影集幫助凱文學到道地的英文，所以他現在說話聽起來不那麼像課本了。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A64","t":"道地的"},{"w":"proverb","pos":"n.","def":"a short well-known saying that gives advice","cn":"諺語","s":"My grandmother often quotes the ________ \"Slow and steady wins the race\", because she wants me to study a little every day.","zh":"我奶奶常常引用諺語「慢而穩者勝」，因為她希望我每天讀一點書。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A65","t":"諺語"},{"w":"collocation","pos":"n.","def":"words that are often used together","cn":"搭配詞","s":"We say \"make a mistake\" but not \"do a mistake\", and learning each common ________ makes your English sound natural.","zh":"我們說「make a mistake」而不是「do a mistake」，而學會每個常見的搭配詞會讓你的英文聽起來很自然。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A66","t":"搭配詞"},{"w":"phrasal verb","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a verb plus a small word like \"up\" or \"off\"","cn":"片語動詞","s":"\"Give up\" is a common ______ ______, and it means to stop trying, which is very different from \"give\".","zh":"「give up」是一個常見的片語動詞，意思是放棄嘗試，這和「give」的意思非常不同。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A67","t":"片語動詞"},{"w":"denotation","pos":"n.","def":"the basic dictionary meaning of a word","cn":"字面意義；本義","s":"The ________ of \"home\" is simply a place where you live, but the word also makes many people think of warmth and family.","zh":"「home」的本義只是你居住的地方，但這個字也讓許多人聯想到溫暖和家庭。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A68","t":"本義"},{"w":"literally","pos":"adv.","def":"in the exact, basic meaning of the words","cn":"照字面地；真正地","s":"The German word \"Handschuh\" ________ means \"hand shoe\", and that is why many learners find it funny.","zh":"德文字「Handschuh」照字面意思是「手鞋」，這就是許多學習者覺得它很好笑的原因。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A69","t":"照字面意思"},{"w":"definition","pos":"n.","def":"a statement that explains what a word means","cn":"定義","s":"I could not understand the ________ in my English dictionary, so I looked at the example sentence instead, and it was much clearer.","zh":"我看不懂英文字典裡的定義，所以我改看例句，結果清楚多了。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A70","t":"定義"},{"w":"informal","pos":"adj.","def":"relaxed and used with friends, not in official situations","cn":"非正式的","s":"\"Hey, what's up?\" is fine in ________ chats with friends, but you should not use it in an email to your teacher.","zh":"「Hey, what's up?」在和朋友非正式的聊天中沒問題，但你不應該在寫給老師的電子郵件中使用它。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A71","t":"非正式的"},{"w":"loanword","pos":"n.","def":"a word taken from another language","cn":"外來語；借詞","s":"\"Sushi\" is a ________ from Japanese, and English has also borrowed words like \"tea\" from Chinese.","zh":"「sushi」是來自日文的外來語，而英文也從中文借了像「tea」這樣的字。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A72","t":"外來語"},{"w":"neologism","pos":"n.","def":"a newly invented word","cn":"新造詞","s":"\"Selfie\" was once a ________, but it became so popular that it was added to major dictionaries in just a few years.","zh":"「selfie」曾經是一個新造詞，但它變得非常流行，所以短短幾年內就被收入主要字典。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A73","t":"新造詞"},{"w":"etymology","pos":"n.","def":"the history and origin of a word","cn":"字源；詞源","s":"I love reading about ________, because finding out that \"salary\" comes from the Latin word for salt is really fun.","zh":"我喜歡閱讀關於字源的東西，因為發現「salary」來自拉丁文的「鹽」真的很有趣。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A74","t":"字源"},{"w":"abbreviation","pos":"n.","def":"a short form of a word or phrase","cn":"縮寫","s":"\"Dr\" is an ________ of \"Doctor\", and you will see many short forms like this on signs and forms.","zh":"「Dr」是「Doctor」的縮寫，而你會在標誌和表格上看到許多像這樣的簡短形式。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A75","t":"縮寫"},{"w":"spelling","pos":"n.","def":"the way letters form a word","cn":"拼字","s":"English ________ can be very confusing, because \"though\", \"through\" and \"tough\" all look similar but sound different.","zh":"英文拼字可能非常令人困惑，因為「though」、「through」和「tough」看起來很像，但發音不同。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A76","t":"拼字"},{"w":"misspell","pos":"v.","def":"to spell a word wrongly","cn":"拼錯","s":"I ________ my teacher's name on the birthday card, so I felt embarrassed and wrote her a new one.","zh":"我在生日卡上拼錯了老師的名字，所以我覺得很尷尬，又重新寫了一張給她。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A77","t":"拼錯"},{"w":"vocabulary","pos":"n.","def":"all the words a person knows or uses","cn":"字彙；詞彙量","s":"Reading for twenty minutes a day can grow your ________ quickly, and you will also learn how words are used in real sentences.","zh":"每天閱讀二十分鐘能快速增加你的字彙，而且你也會學到單字在真實句子中如何使用。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A78","t":"字彙"},{"w":"word family","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a group of words that share the same root","cn":"字族","s":"\"Decide\", \"decision\" and \"decisive\" belong to the same ______ ______, so learning one helps you understand the others.","zh":"「decide」、「decision」和「decisive」屬於同一個字族，所以學會其中一個能幫助你理解其他的。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A79","t":"字族"},{"w":"profanity","pos":"n.","def":"rude or offensive words","cn":"髒話；粗話","s":"The film contains a lot of ________, so the cinema did not allow children under fifteen to watch it.","zh":"那部電影包含大量的髒話，所以電影院不允許十五歲以下的孩子觀看。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A80","t":"髒話"},{"w":"pun","pos":"n.","def":"a joke that uses a word with two meanings","cn":"雙關語","s":"My dad loves telling a bad ________ at dinner, like \"I'm reading a book about glue, and I can't put it down.\"","zh":"我爸爸喜歡在晚餐時講冷雙關語，像是「我在讀一本關於膠水的書，我放不下它。」","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A81","t":"雙關語"},{"w":"wordplay","pos":"n.","def":"the clever or funny use of words","cn":"文字遊戲","s":"Advertisers often use ________ in their slogans, because a clever joke helps customers remember the product.","zh":"廣告商常常在標語中使用文字遊戲，因為巧妙的玩笑能幫助顧客記住產品。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A82","t":"文字遊戲"},{"w":"palindrome","pos":"n.","def":"a word that reads the same backwards and forwards","cn":"迴文","s":"\"Level\" is a ________, because you can read it from the left or from the right and it stays the same.","zh":"「level」是一個迴文，因為你可以從左邊或右邊讀它，而它都保持不變。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A83","t":"迴文"},{"w":"onomatopoeia","pos":"n.","def":"a word that copies the sound it describes","cn":"擬聲詞；狀聲詞","s":"Comic books are full of ________ like \"boom\" and \"crash\", and these sound words make the action feel exciting.","zh":"漫畫書裡充滿了像「boom」和「crash」這樣的狀聲詞，而這些聲音詞讓動作場面感覺很刺激。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A84","t":"狀聲詞"},{"w":"simile","pos":"n.","def":"a comparison using \"like\" or \"as\"","cn":"明喻","s":"\"She runs like the wind\" is a ________, and writers use comparisons like this to help readers picture a scene.","zh":"「她跑得像風一樣」是一個明喻，而作家用這樣的比較來幫助讀者想像畫面。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A85","t":"明喻"},{"w":"alliteration","pos":"n.","def":"using several words that start with the same sound","cn":"頭韻","s":"Many brands use ________, like \"Coca-Cola\" and \"PayPal\", because names with repeated sounds are easy to remember.","zh":"許多品牌使用頭韻，像「Coca-Cola」和「PayPal」，因為有重複聲音的名字很容易記住。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A86","t":"頭韻"},{"w":"oxymoron","pos":"n.","def":"two words with opposite meanings used together","cn":"矛盾修飾法","s":"\"Jumbo shrimp\" is a funny ________, because \"jumbo\" means very big while \"shrimp\" usually means something small.","zh":"「jumbo shrimp（巨無霸小蝦）」是一個有趣的矛盾修飾法，因為「jumbo」表示非常大，而「shrimp」通常表示很小的東西。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A87","t":"矛盾修飾法"},{"w":"usage","pos":"n.","def":"the way words are normally used","cn":"用法","s":"The dictionary gives notes on ________, so learners can see whether a word is polite, rude, formal or old-fashioned.","zh":"這本字典有關於用法的說明，所以學習者能看出一個字是禮貌的、粗魯的、正式的還是過時的。","part":"A","sec":"Words, Meaning & Usage 詞彙、語意與用法","lab":"A88","t":"用法"},{"w":"script","pos":"n.","def":"a set of letters or symbols used for writing a language","cn":"文字；書寫系統","s":"Korean uses a ________ called Hangul, and many learners can read it after only a few days of practice.","zh":"韓文使用一種叫做韓文字母的文字，而許多學習者只要練習幾天就能閱讀。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A89","t":"文字"},{"w":"writing system","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way a language is written down","cn":"書寫系統","s":"Japanese has a complex ______ ______, because it mixes Chinese characters with two different sets of sound symbols.","zh":"日文有一套複雜的書寫系統，因為它混合了漢字和兩套不同的表音符號。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A90","t":"書寫系統"},{"w":"Chinese character","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a single written symbol used in Chinese","cn":"漢字；中文字","s":"Each ______ ______ has its own meaning, so foreign students must remember thousands of them before they can read a newspaper.","zh":"每個中文字都有自己的意思，所以外國學生必須記住好幾千個字才能讀報紙。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A91","t":"中文字"},{"w":"pictograph","pos":"n.","def":"a picture used as a written sign for a word","cn":"象形文字","s":"The ________ for \"mountain\" looks like three peaks, so children enjoy guessing what these old picture-words mean.","zh":"代表「山」的象形文字看起來像三座山峰，所以孩子們很喜歡猜這些古老圖畫文字的意思。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A92","t":"象形文字"},{"w":"ideogram","pos":"n.","def":"a written symbol that shows an idea","cn":"表意文字","s":"The no-smoking sign is a modern ________, because people from any country can understand it without reading a word.","zh":"禁菸標誌是一種現代的表意符號，因為任何國家的人不用讀任何字就能看懂。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A93","t":"表意符號"},{"w":"calligraphy","pos":"n.","def":"the art of beautiful handwriting","cn":"書法","s":"My grandfather practises Chinese ________ every morning, and he says that holding the brush calmly helps him relax.","zh":"我爺爺每天早上練習中國書法，而他說平穩地握著毛筆能幫助他放鬆。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A94","t":"書法"},{"w":"handwriting","pos":"n.","def":"the way a person writes by hand","cn":"筆跡；手寫字","s":"The doctor's ________ was so messy that the pharmacist could not read it, so she called the clinic to check the medicine.","zh":"那位醫生的字跡太潦草了，藥劑師看不懂，所以她打電話到診所確認藥物。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A95","t":"字跡"},{"w":"literate","pos":"adj.","def":"able to read and write","cn":"識字的","s":"Only half of the adults in the village were ________ in 1950, but today almost every young person there can read and write.","zh":"1950 年時那個村莊只有一半的成人識字，但如今那裡幾乎每個年輕人都能讀寫。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A96","t":"識字"},{"w":"illiterate","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to read or write","cn":"不識字的；文盲的","s":"Her great-grandmother was ________ because girls could not go to school then, so she asked her son to read letters for her.","zh":"她的曾祖母不識字，因為當時女孩不能上學，所以她請兒子幫她讀信。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A97","t":"不識字"},{"w":"punctuation","pos":"n.","def":"marks like commas and full stops used in writing","cn":"標點符號","s":"Without correct ________, a sentence can be very confusing, so always check your commas before you hand in an essay.","zh":"如果沒有正確的標點符號，一個句子可能會非常令人困惑，所以交作文前一定要檢查你的逗號。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A98","t":"標點符號"},{"w":"comma","pos":"n.","def":"the punctuation mark ( , )","cn":"逗號","s":"\"Let's eat, Grandma\" and \"Let's eat Grandma\" mean very different things, so one small ________ can save a life.","zh":"「我們吃飯吧，奶奶」和「我們吃奶奶吧」意思非常不同，所以一個小小的逗號能救一條命。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A99","t":"逗號"},{"w":"apostrophe","pos":"n.","def":"the mark ( ' ) used in words like \"it's\" or \"Tom's\"","cn":"撇號","s":"Many people put an ________ in \"its\" by mistake, but \"it's\" only means \"it is\" or \"it has\".","zh":"很多人錯誤地在「its」中加上撇號，但「it's」只表示「it is」或「it has」。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A100","t":"撇號"},{"w":"quotation marks","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the marks (\" \") used around someone's exact words","cn":"引號","s":"When you copy a sentence from a website, put it in ______ ______, or your teacher may think you are cheating.","zh":"當你從網站複製一個句子時，要把它放在引號裡，否則你的老師可能會認為你在作弊。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A101","t":"引號"},{"w":"hyphen","pos":"n.","def":"a short line ( - ) that joins words","cn":"連字號","s":"We write \"well-known\" with a ________ when it comes before a noun, but many students forget this small rule.","zh":"當「well-known」放在名詞前面時，我們要用連字號來寫，但許多學生忘了這個小規則。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A102","t":"連字號"},{"w":"capital letter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a big letter such as A, B or C","cn":"大寫字母","s":"Every English sentence begins with a ______ ______, and names of people and countries also need one.","zh":"每個英文句子都以大寫字母開頭，而人名和國名也需要。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A103","t":"大寫字母"},{"w":"cursive","pos":"n.","def":"handwriting where the letters are joined together","cn":"草寫體","s":"Some schools no longer teach ________, so many young people cannot read old letters written by their grandparents.","zh":"有些學校不再教草寫，所以許多年輕人看不懂祖父母寫的舊信。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A104","t":"草寫"},{"w":"spell-checker","pos":"n.","def":"a computer program that finds spelling mistakes","cn":"拼字檢查程式","s":"The ________ did not notice that I wrote \"form\" instead of \"from\", because both are real English words.","zh":"拼字檢查程式沒有發現我把「from」寫成了「form」，因為兩個都是真正的英文字。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A105","t":"拼字檢查程式"},{"w":"autocorrect","pos":"n.","def":"a phone function that changes words it thinks are wrong","cn":"自動校正","s":"My phone's ________ changed \"meet you at five\" to \"meat you at five\", and my friend laughed at my message all day.","zh":"我手機的自動校正把「五點見」改成了「五點肉你」，我朋友一整天都在笑我的訊息。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A106","t":"自動校正"},{"w":"typo","pos":"n.","def":"a small mistake in typing","cn":"打字錯誤","s":"There was a ________ on the restaurant menu that said \"fried lice\" instead of \"fried rice\", so many tourists took photos of it.","zh":"餐廳菜單上有一個打字錯誤，把「炒飯」寫成了「炒蝨子」，所以很多觀光客都拍照留念。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A107","t":"打字錯誤"},{"w":"paragraph","pos":"n.","def":"a group of sentences about one main idea","cn":"段落","s":"Each ________ in your essay should start with a clear topic sentence, and the other sentences should support that idea.","zh":"你文章中的每個段落都應以清楚的主題句開頭，而其他句子應該支持那個想法。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A108","t":"段落"},{"w":"phonics","pos":"n.","def":"a way of teaching reading through letter sounds","cn":"自然發音法","s":"Young children learn ________ in their first year of school, so they can sound out new words like \"c-a-t\" by themselves.","zh":"幼童在上學第一年學習自然發音法，所以他們能自己拼讀出像「c-a-t」這樣的新字。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A109","t":"自然發音法"},{"w":"romanisation","pos":"n.","def":"writing a language in the Latin alphabet","cn":"羅馬拼音化","s":"Street signs in Taipei use ________ for place names, so foreign visitors can find stations even if they cannot read Chinese.","zh":"台北的路標對地名使用羅馬拼音，所以外國遊客即使看不懂中文也能找到車站。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A110","t":"羅馬拼音"},{"w":"pinyin","pos":"n.","def":"the official system for writing Chinese sounds with Roman letters","cn":"漢語拼音","s":"Many foreigners learn ________ before they learn characters, because it helps them pronounce Mandarin words correctly.","zh":"許多外國人在學漢字之前先學漢語拼音，因為它能幫助他們正確發出國語字詞的音。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A111","t":"漢語拼音"},{"w":"transliterate","pos":"v.","def":"to write words using the letters of another alphabet","cn":"音譯；轉寫","s":"Passport officers ________ Chinese names into English letters, but the same name can be spelled in several different ways.","zh":"護照官員會把中文名字音譯成英文字母，但同一個名字可能有好幾種不同的拼法。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A112","t":"音譯"},{"w":"scribble","pos":"v.","def":"to write something quickly and carelessly","cn":"潦草地寫","s":"I ________ the phone number on my hand because I had no paper, but later I could not read the last two numbers.","zh":"我因為沒有紙，就把電話號碼潦草地寫在手上，但後來我看不清最後兩個數字。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A113","t":"潦草地寫"},{"w":"word processor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a computer program for writing documents","cn":"文書處理軟體","s":"Most students write their reports with a ______ ______, because it is easy to change sentences and check spelling.","zh":"大多數學生用文書處理軟體寫報告，因為它很容易修改句子和檢查拼字。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A114","t":"文書處理軟體"},{"w":"full stop","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the mark ( . ) at the end of a sentence","cn":"句號","s":"Remember to put a ______ ______ at the end of each sentence, or your reader will not know where one idea ends.","zh":"記得在每個句子結尾加上句號，否則你的讀者不會知道一個想法在哪裡結束。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A115","t":"句號"},{"w":"question mark","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the mark ( ? ) at the end of a question","cn":"問號","s":"Spanish puts an upside-down ______ ______ at the start of a question, while English only uses one at the end.","zh":"西班牙文會在問句開頭放一個倒過來的問號，而英文只在句尾用一個。","part":"A","sec":"Reading, Writing & Scripts 讀寫與文字系統","lab":"A116","t":"問號"},{"w":"foreign language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language that is not spoken in your own country","cn":"外語","s":"Learning a ______ ______ opens many doors, because you can travel more easily and make friends from other cultures.","zh":"學習一門外語能打開許多扇門，因為你可以更輕鬆地旅行，也能結交其他文化的朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A117","t":"外語"},{"w":"target language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the language you are learning or translating into","cn":"目標語言","s":"Try to think in the ______ ______ when you speak, because translating every sentence in your head makes you slow.","zh":"說話時試著用目標語言思考，因為在腦中翻譯每個句子會讓你變慢。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A118","t":"目標語言"},{"w":"language barrier","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a problem in communication caused by different languages","cn":"語言障礙","s":"There was a ______ ______ between the doctor and the tourist, so the hospital called a volunteer who spoke Thai.","zh":"醫生和那位觀光客之間存在語言障礙，所以醫院找來一位會說泰語的志工。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A119","t":"語言障礙"},{"w":"language exchange","pos":"n.phr.","def":"meeting someone to practise each other's languages","cn":"語言交換","s":"I joined a ______ ______ with a student from Spain, so I teach her Chinese for an hour and she teaches me Spanish.","zh":"我和一位來自西班牙的學生參加了語言交換，所以我教她一小時中文，她教我西班牙文。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A120","t":"語言交換"},{"w":"polyglot","pos":"n.","def":"a person who can speak many languages","cn":"通曉多種語言的人","s":"My uncle is a ________ who speaks seven languages, and he says the secret is to practise a little every single day.","zh":"我叔叔是一位會說七種語言的多語者，而他說祕訣就是每天練習一點點。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A121","t":"多語者"},{"w":"trilingual","pos":"adj.","def":"able to speak three languages","cn":"會說三種語言的","s":"Children in Singapore often grow up ________, because they speak English at school and other languages with their families.","zh":"新加坡的孩子常常在三語環境中長大，因為他們在學校說英文，和家人說其他語言。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A122","t":"三語"},{"w":"converse","pos":"v.","def":"to have a conversation","cn":"交談","s":"After a year in Tokyo, Ben could ________ easily with shop owners, although he still found business meetings difficult.","zh":"在東京待了一年後，班已經能輕鬆地和店主交談，雖然他仍覺得商務會議很困難。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A123","t":"交談"},{"w":"chat","pos":"v.","def":"to talk in a friendly, informal way","cn":"聊天","s":"We ________ with the hotel staff every morning, so by the end of the trip our Italian had improved a lot.","zh":"我們每天早上都和飯店員工聊天，所以到旅行結束時，我們的義大利文進步了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A124","t":"聊天"},{"w":"language learner","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who is studying a language","cn":"語言學習者","s":"Every ______ ______ makes mistakes, so don't be afraid to speak, because mistakes show you what to practise next.","zh":"每個語言學習者都會犯錯，所以不要害怕開口，因為錯誤會告訴你接下來該練習什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A125","t":"語言學習者"},{"w":"speaking test","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an exam where you talk to an examiner","cn":"口說測驗","s":"I felt nervous before the IELTS ______ ______, but the examiner smiled and asked easy questions about my hometown first.","zh":"在雅思口說測驗前我很緊張，但考官面帶微笑，先問了一些關於我家鄉的簡單問題。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A126","t":"口說測驗"},{"w":"listening comprehension","pos":"n.phr.","def":"understanding what you hear","cn":"聽力理解","s":"Watching the news in English improved my ______ ______, and now I can follow lectures without reading the subtitles.","zh":"看英文新聞提升了我的聽力理解，現在我不看字幕也能聽懂講座。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A127","t":"聽力理解"},{"w":"conversational","pos":"adj.","def":"suitable for everyday talking","cn":"會話的；日常交談的","s":"She only has ________ Japanese, so she can order food and ask for directions, but she cannot read business documents.","zh":"她只會日常會話程度的日文，所以她能點餐和問路，但看不懂商業文件。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A128","t":"日常會話程度的"},{"w":"self-correct","pos":"v.","def":"to notice and fix your own mistakes","cn":"自我修正","s":"Good speakers often ________ in the middle of a sentence, and examiners see this as a sign of strong language awareness.","zh":"好的說話者常常在句子說到一半時自我修正，而考官把這看作語言意識強的跡象。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A129","t":"自我修正"},{"w":"native-like","pos":"adj.","def":"very close to the way a native speaker talks","cn":"接近母語的","s":"Her pronunciation is almost ________, so most people think she grew up in London, even though she was born in Tainan.","zh":"她的發音幾乎像母語人士一樣，所以大多數人以為她在倫敦長大，即使她出生在台南。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A130","t":"像母語人士一樣"},{"w":"shadowing","pos":"n.","def":"repeating what a speaker says right after hearing it","cn":"跟讀法","s":"My tutor suggested ________ to improve my speaking, so I repeat each line of a podcast a second after I hear it.","zh":"我的家教建議用跟讀法來提升口說，所以我會在聽到播客的每一句後一秒就跟著複述。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A131","t":"跟讀法"},{"w":"expat","pos":"n.","def":"a person living in a foreign country","cn":"旅居海外者；外籍人士","s":"As an ________ in Taipei, Mark took Chinese lessons, because he wanted to talk with his neighbours and not only with foreigners.","zh":"身為在台北的外籍人士，馬克上了中文課，因為他想和鄰居交談，而不只是和外國人說話。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A132","t":"外籍人士"},{"w":"verbalise","pos":"v.","def":"to express ideas or feelings in words","cn":"用言語表達","s":"Young children often cry when they are upset, because they cannot ________ their feelings clearly yet.","zh":"幼兒難過時常常哭，因為他們還無法清楚地用言語表達自己的感受。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A133","t":"用言語表達"},{"w":"interlocutor","pos":"n.","def":"a person you are talking with","cn":"對話者","s":"In the speaking exam you should look at your ________ and respond to their questions, rather than reciting a memorised speech.","zh":"在口說考試中，你應該看著你的對話者並回應他們的問題，而不是背誦事先記好的講稿。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A134","t":"對話者"},{"w":"greeting","pos":"n.","def":"words you say when you meet someone","cn":"問候語；打招呼","s":"In Japan a bow is a common ________, but in many Western countries people usually shake hands or wave.","zh":"在日本，鞠躬是常見的打招呼方式，但在許多西方國家，人們通常握手或揮手。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A135","t":"打招呼方式"},{"w":"farewell","pos":"n.","def":"the act of saying goodbye","cn":"告別；道別","s":"We said our ________ at the airport, and my host family gave me a card written in English and Chinese.","zh":"我們在機場道別，而我的寄宿家庭送了我一張用英文和中文寫的卡片。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A136","t":"道別"},{"w":"politeness","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of behaving and speaking with respect","cn":"禮貌","s":"In English, ________ often means adding \"could you\" or \"please\", so \"Give me water\" may sound rude to a waiter.","zh":"在英文中，禮貌常常意味著加上「could you」或「please」，所以對服務生說「給我水」聽起來可能很無禮。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A137","t":"禮貌"},{"w":"honorific","pos":"n.","def":"a word or title that shows respect","cn":"敬語；尊稱","s":"Korean has a special ________ ending for older people, so young learners must think carefully about who they are talking to.","zh":"韓文對長輩有特別的敬語字尾，所以年輕的學習者必須仔細想想自己在跟誰說話。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A138","t":"敬語"},{"w":"formality","pos":"n.","def":"the level of politeness and seriousness in language","cn":"正式程度","s":"The ________ of your email should match the reader, so you write \"Dear Professor Lin\" but \"Hi Amy\" to a friend.","zh":"你電子郵件的正式程度應該配合讀者，所以你會寫「親愛的林教授」，但寫給朋友就寫「嗨，艾咪」。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A139","t":"正式程度"},{"w":"language partner","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person you practise a language with","cn":"語伴","s":"My ______ ______ lives in Canada, so we video chat every Sunday, and she corrects my grammar very kindly.","zh":"我的語伴住在加拿大，所以我們每週日視訊聊天，而她會很親切地糾正我的文法。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A140","t":"語伴"},{"w":"language skills","pos":"n.phr.","def":"abilities in listening, speaking, reading and writing","cn":"語言能力","s":"Employers value strong ______ ______, so people who can write clear English emails often get better jobs.","zh":"雇主重視良好的語言能力，所以能寫清楚英文電子郵件的人常常找到更好的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A141","t":"語言能力"},{"w":"phrasebook","pos":"n.","def":"a small book of useful phrases for travellers","cn":"常用語手冊","s":"We carried a Thai ________ on our trip, but most of the time we used hand signals and smiles instead.","zh":"我們旅行時帶了一本泰語常用語手冊，但大多數時候我們還是用手勢和微笑溝通。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A142","t":"常用語手冊"},{"w":"language course","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a series of lessons to learn a language","cn":"語言課程","s":"She took a six-week ______ ______ in Seoul last summer, and she can now read menus and chat with taxi drivers.","zh":"她去年夏天在首爾上了六週的語言課程，現在她能看懂菜單，也能和計程車司機聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A143","t":"語言課程"},{"w":"crash course","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a short, fast course that teaches the basics","cn":"速成課程","s":"Before his business trip to Germany, my dad took a ______ ______ in German, but he still needed an app in meetings.","zh":"在去德國出差之前，我爸爸上了一個德文速成課程，但他在會議中仍需要用應用程式。","part":"A","sec":"Learning & Using Languages 語言學習與使用","lab":"A144","t":"速成課程"},{"w":"translator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who changes written text into another language","cn":"譯者；翻譯者","s":"The ________ spent two years on the Harry Potter books, because she wanted every joke and name to work in Chinese.","zh":"這位譯者花了兩年翻譯哈利波特系列，因為她希望每個笑話和名字在中文裡都行得通。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A145","t":"譯者"},{"w":"translation","pos":"n.","def":"text or speech changed into another language","cn":"翻譯；譯文","s":"I read the novel in English and then in ________, and I noticed that some funny lines lost their humour.","zh":"我先讀了這本小說的英文版，接著讀了譯本，而我注意到有些好笑的句子失去了幽默感。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A146","t":"譯本"},{"w":"interpreter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who changes spoken words into another language","cn":"口譯員","s":"The president spoke in French, so an ________ stood beside him and repeated everything in English for the audience.","zh":"總統用法文演講，所以一位口譯員站在他身旁，為觀眾把所有內容用英文重述一遍。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A147","t":"口譯員"},{"w":"source language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the language that you translate from","cn":"來源語言","s":"When I translate a menu, Chinese is the ______ ______, and English is the language I translate into.","zh":"當我翻譯菜單時，中文是來源語言，而英文是我翻譯成的語言。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A148","t":"來源語言"},{"w":"source text","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the original text that is being translated","cn":"原文","s":"A good translator reads the whole ______ ______ first, because the meaning of the beginning may depend on the ending.","zh":"好的譯者會先讀完整篇原文，因為開頭的意思可能取決於結尾。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A149","t":"原文"},{"w":"mistranslate","pos":"v.","def":"to translate something wrongly","cn":"誤譯；翻錯","s":"The sign ________ \"slippery floor\" as \"carefully slide\", so tourists took funny photos, but nobody understood the warning.","zh":"那個標誌把「地板濕滑」翻錯成「小心地滑」，所以觀光客拍了好笑的照片，但沒人看懂這個警告。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A150","t":"翻錯"},{"w":"machine translation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"translation done by a computer","cn":"機器翻譯","s":"______ ______ is fast and free, but it can still make strange mistakes with idioms and jokes.","zh":"機器翻譯又快又免費，但它在慣用語和笑話上仍可能犯奇怪的錯誤。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A151","t":"機器翻譯"},{"w":"simultaneous interpreting","pos":"n.phr.","def":"interpreting while the speaker is still talking","cn":"同步口譯","s":"______ ______ is very tiring, so interpreters at the United Nations usually change places every thirty minutes.","zh":"同步口譯非常累人，所以聯合國的口譯員通常每三十分鐘換一次班。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A152","t":"同步口譯"},{"w":"consecutive interpreting","pos":"n.phr.","def":"interpreting after the speaker stops for a moment","cn":"逐步口譯","s":"In ______ ______ the speaker pauses after a few sentences, and then the interpreter repeats the message in the other language.","zh":"在逐步口譯中，講者說幾句後會停頓，然後口譯員用另一種語言重述訊息。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A153","t":"逐步口譯"},{"w":"dub","pos":"v.","def":"to replace the voices in a film with another language","cn":"配音","s":"Many cartoons are ________ into Mandarin for young children, because they cannot read subtitles fast enough.","zh":"許多卡通會配上國語給幼兒看，因為他們讀字幕的速度不夠快。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A154","t":"配上"},{"w":"localise","pos":"v.","def":"to change a product to suit a local market and language","cn":"在地化","s":"The company had to ________ its game for Taiwan, so it changed the jokes and added local foods to the story.","zh":"這家公司必須為台灣把遊戲在地化，所以它改了笑話，並在故事中加入了當地食物。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A155","t":"在地化"},{"w":"subtitling","pos":"n.","def":"the work of adding translated words at the bottom of a screen","cn":"字幕翻譯","s":"________ is harder than it looks, because translators must fit each line into the screen while people are still speaking.","zh":"字幕翻譯比看起來難，因為譯者必須在人物仍在說話時把每一行塞進螢幕裡。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A156","t":"字幕翻譯"},{"w":"literal translation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a translation that follows the words exactly","cn":"直譯","s":"A ______ ______ of \"break a leg\" sounds terrible in Chinese, but the phrase actually means \"good luck\" to actors.","zh":"「break a leg」的直譯在中文裡聽起來很可怕，但這個片語對演員來說其實是「祝好運」的意思。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A157","t":"直譯"},{"w":"free translation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a translation that keeps the meaning but changes the words","cn":"意譯","s":"The poet chose a ______ ______, because keeping the rhyme and feeling was more important to her than copying every word.","zh":"這位詩人選擇了意譯，因為對她來說保留押韻和情感比照抄每個字更重要。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A158","t":"意譯"},{"w":"back-translation","pos":"n.","def":"translating a text back into its first language to check it","cn":"回譯","s":"The medical team used ________ to check the survey, so a second translator turned the Chinese version back into English.","zh":"醫療團隊用回譯來檢查問卷，所以由第二位譯者把中文版翻回英文。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A159","t":"回譯"},{"w":"faithful","pos":"adj.","def":"keeping close to the original meaning","cn":"忠實的","s":"Her translation is ________ to the original novel, but it also reads naturally, which is why it won an award.","zh":"她的譯文忠於原著小說，但讀起來也很自然，這就是它得獎的原因。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A160","t":"忠於"},{"w":"untranslatable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to translate exactly","cn":"無法翻譯的","s":"The Danish word \"hygge\" is often called ________, because no single English word captures that cosy, happy feeling.","zh":"丹麥字「hygge」常被稱為無法翻譯的，因為沒有一個英文字能抓住那種溫馨、快樂的感覺。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A161","t":"無法翻譯的"},{"w":"gloss","pos":"n.","def":"a short explanation of a difficult word in a text","cn":"注釋；註解","s":"The textbook gives a Chinese ________ beside each difficult word, so students can keep reading without opening a dictionary.","zh":"課本在每個難字旁邊都附上中文註解，所以學生不用翻字典就能繼續讀下去。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A162","t":"註解"},{"w":"footnote","pos":"n.","def":"a note at the bottom of a page","cn":"註腳","s":"The translator added a ________ to explain the Chinese joke, because English readers would not understand it otherwise.","zh":"譯者加了一個註腳來解釋這個中文笑話，因為否則英文讀者不會懂。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A163","t":"註腳"},{"w":"interpreter booth","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small soundproof room where interpreters work","cn":"口譯廂","s":"The two interpreters sat in a glass ______ ______ at the back of the hall, and they could see every speaker clearly.","zh":"兩位口譯員坐在大廳後方的玻璃口譯廂裡，而他們能清楚看到每位講者。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A164","t":"口譯廂"},{"w":"earpiece","pos":"n.","def":"a small device worn in the ear to hear sound","cn":"耳機","s":"Each delegate wore an ________ during the meeting, so they could hear the speech in their own language.","zh":"每位代表在會議中都戴著耳機，所以他們能聽到用自己語言播出的演講。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A165","t":"耳機"},{"w":"sight translation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"reading a document in one language aloud in another","cn":"視譯","s":"The court interpreter did a ______ ______ of the letter, so she read the Vietnamese text aloud in Chinese for the judge.","zh":"法庭口譯員對那封信做了視譯，所以她把越南文內容直接用中文唸給法官聽。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A166","t":"視譯"},{"w":"court interpreter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an interpreter who works in courtrooms","cn":"法庭口譯員","s":"The ______ ______ must translate every word exactly, because a small mistake could change the result of a trial.","zh":"法庭口譯員必須精確翻譯每一個字，因為一個小錯誤就可能改變審判的結果。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A167","t":"法庭口譯員"},{"w":"speech-to-text","pos":"adj.","def":"changing spoken words into written words automatically","cn":"語音轉文字的","s":"The teacher uses a ________ app in class, so deaf students can read her words on their tablets as she speaks.","zh":"老師在課堂上使用語音轉文字的應用程式，所以聽障學生能在她說話時從平板上讀到她的話。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A168","t":"語音轉文字的"},{"w":"translation app","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a phone program that translates words or speech","cn":"翻譯應用程式","s":"We used a ______ ______ to read the menu in Seoul, but it translated one dish as \"angry chicken\", which made us laugh.","zh":"我們在首爾用翻譯應用程式看菜單，但它把一道菜翻成「生氣的雞」，讓我們笑了出來。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A169","t":"翻譯應用程式"},{"w":"neural machine translation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"computer translation that uses AI networks to learn from data","cn":"神經機器翻譯","s":"______ ______ ______ produces smoother sentences than older systems, because it looks at whole sentences instead of single words.","zh":"神經機器翻譯產生的句子比舊系統更流暢，因為它看的是整個句子而不是單一的字。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A170","t":"神經機器翻譯"},{"w":"post-editing","pos":"n.","def":"fixing a machine translation by a human","cn":"譯後編輯","s":"Many translators now do ________, so they check and correct AI translations instead of starting from a blank page.","zh":"許多譯者現在做譯後編輯，所以他們檢查和修正 AI 的翻譯，而不是從一張白紙開始。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A171","t":"譯後編輯"},{"w":"language pair","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the two languages a translator works between","cn":"語言對","s":"Her main ______ ______ is Japanese to Chinese, but she also accepts some simple English projects.","zh":"她主要的語言對是日譯中，但她也接一些簡單的英文案子。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A172","t":"語言對"},{"w":"voice-over","pos":"n.","def":"a voice heard in a film or video without seeing the speaker","cn":"旁白；畫外音","s":"The documentary had a Chinese ________, so we could understand the story while we watched the animals in Africa.","zh":"這部紀錄片有中文旁白，所以我們能一邊看非洲的動物，一邊了解故事內容。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A173","t":"旁白"},{"w":"speech translation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"technology that translates spoken language aloud","cn":"語音翻譯","s":"New earbuds offer instant ______ ______, so two travellers can talk to each other even if they share no language.","zh":"新型耳機提供即時語音翻譯，所以即使兩位旅客沒有共通語言，也能彼此交談。","part":"A","sec":"Translation & Interpreting 翻譯與口譯","lab":"A174","t":"語音翻譯"},{"w":"language family","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a group of languages that come from one older language","cn":"語系","s":"English and Hindi belong to the same ______ ______, although speakers of the two languages cannot understand each other today.","zh":"英文和印地文屬於同一個語系，雖然兩種語言的使用者如今無法聽懂彼此。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A175","t":"語系"},{"w":"lingua franca","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a shared language used by people with different first languages","cn":"通用語","s":"English has become a ______ ______ in international business, so a Japanese manager and a Brazilian client may talk in English.","zh":"英文已成為國際商務的通用語，所以一位日本經理和一位巴西客戶可能會用英文交談。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A176","t":"通用語"},{"w":"official language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language used by a government and in law","cn":"官方語言","s":"Canada has two ______ ______, so road signs and food labels there use both English and French.","zh":"加拿大有兩種官方語言，所以那裡的路標和食品標籤同時使用英文和法文。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A177","t":"官方語言"},{"w":"minority language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language spoken by a small part of a population","cn":"少數語言","s":"Welsh is a ______ ______ in the UK, but children can now study all their subjects in Welsh at many schools.","zh":"威爾斯語在英國是一種少數語言，但現在許多學校的孩子可以用威爾斯語學習所有科目。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A178","t":"少數語言"},{"w":"endangered language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language that may soon have no speakers","cn":"瀕危語言","s":"An ______ ______ often has only older speakers, because young people move to cities and use the national language instead.","zh":"瀕危語言常常只剩年長的使用者，因為年輕人搬到城市並改用國家語言。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A179","t":"瀕危語言"},{"w":"language death","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when the last speakers of a language die out","cn":"語言消亡","s":"______ ______ is happening faster than ever, and experts believe half of the world's languages may disappear this century.","zh":"語言消亡正以前所未有的速度發生，而專家認為世界上一半的語言可能會在本世紀消失。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A180","t":"語言消亡"},{"w":"language revival","pos":"n.phr.","def":"efforts to bring a disappearing language back into use","cn":"語言復振","s":"Hebrew is the most famous ______ ______ story, because it became an everyday language again after many centuries.","zh":"希伯來文是最有名的語言復振故事，因為它在許多世紀後再次成為日常語言。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A181","t":"語言復振"},{"w":"creole","pos":"n.","def":"a language that grew from mixing two languages and became a first language","cn":"克里奧爾語；混合語","s":"In Haiti most people speak a French-based ________, and children learn it at home as their first language.","zh":"在海地，大多數人說一種以法文為基礎的克里奧爾語，而孩子們在家把它當作第一語言學習。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A182","t":"克里奧爾語"},{"w":"pidgin","pos":"n.","def":"a simple mixed language used for trade between groups","cn":"洋涇濱語；混雜語","s":"Sailors and traders once used a simple ________ to do business, although nobody spoke it as their mother tongue.","zh":"水手和商人曾經用一種簡單的混雜語做生意，雖然沒有人把它當作母語。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A183","t":"混雜語"},{"w":"language contact","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when speakers of different languages meet and influence each other","cn":"語言接觸","s":"Taiwanese Mandarin has many Japanese and Hokkien words because of ______ ______, and these words are now part of daily life.","zh":"由於語言接觸，台灣華語有許多日語和閩南語詞彙，而這些詞如今已成為日常生活的一部分。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A184","t":"語言接觸"},{"w":"global English","pos":"n.phr.","def":"English used around the world as an international language","cn":"全球英語","s":"Teachers who promote ______ ______ say that clear communication matters more than sounding British or American.","zh":"推廣全球英語的老師說，清楚溝通比聽起來像英國人或美國人更重要。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A185","t":"全球英語"},{"w":"World Englishes","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the different kinds of English used in different countries","cn":"世界英語變體","s":"Singapore, India and Nigeria all have their own ______ ______, and each variety has special words and accents.","zh":"新加坡、印度和奈及利亞都有自己的世界英語變體，而每一種都有特別的詞彙和口音。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A186","t":"世界英語變體"},{"w":"calque","pos":"n.","def":"a phrase translated word by word from another language","cn":"仿譯詞","s":"\"Long time no see\" may be a ________ from Chinese, because it follows the Chinese word order rather than normal English grammar.","zh":"「Long time no see」可能是來自中文的仿譯詞，因為它遵循中文的詞序，而不是一般的英文文法。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A187","t":"仿譯詞"},{"w":"language shift","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when a community stops using one language and uses another","cn":"語言轉移","s":"In many immigrant families a ______ ______ happens within three generations, so the grandchildren speak only the new country's language.","zh":"在許多移民家庭中，語言轉移在三代之內就會發生，所以孫子輩只會說新國家的語言。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A188","t":"語言轉移"},{"w":"last speaker","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the final living person who speaks a language","cn":"最後的使用者","s":"When the ______ ______ of a language dies, many old songs and stories can disappear unless someone records them first.","zh":"當一種語言的最後一位使用者去世時，許多古老的歌曲和故事可能就此消失，除非有人先把它們錄下來。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A189","t":"最後一位使用者"},{"w":"oral tradition","pos":"n.phr.","def":"stories and knowledge passed on by speaking, not writing","cn":"口述傳統","s":"The tribe had no written language, but its ______ ______ kept their history alive, because elders told the stories again and again.","zh":"這個部落沒有文字，但他們的口述傳統讓歷史延續下來，因為長老們一再地講述那些故事。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A190","t":"口述傳統"},{"w":"linguistic diversity","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the variety of different languages in a place","cn":"語言多樣性","s":"Papua New Guinea has amazing ______ ______, because more than 800 languages are spoken there by fewer than ten million people.","zh":"巴布亞紐幾內亞擁有驚人的語言多樣性，因為不到一千萬人在那裡使用超過八百種語言。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A191","t":"語言多樣性"},{"w":"language policy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a government's rules about which languages are used","cn":"語言政策","s":"The new ______ ______ requires schools to teach a local language, so every pupil now has at least one hour of it each week.","zh":"新的語言政策要求學校教授一種本土語言，所以每位學生現在每週至少有一小時這門課。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A192","t":"語言政策"},{"w":"mother-tongue education","pos":"n.phr.","def":"teaching children in their first language","cn":"母語教育","s":"Research supports ______ ______ in the early years, because children learn to read faster in a language they already speak.","zh":"研究支持在早年實施母語教育，因為孩子用他們已經會說的語言學習閱讀會更快。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A193","t":"母語教育"},{"w":"proto-language","pos":"n.","def":"an ancient language that later languages developed from","cn":"原始語","s":"Linguists have rebuilt many words of the ________ behind European languages, even though nobody ever wrote it down.","zh":"語言學家已經重建了歐洲語言背後那個原始語的許多字詞，即使從來沒有人把它寫下來。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A194","t":"原始語"},{"w":"Esperanto","pos":"n.","def":"an invented language created to be easy for everyone","cn":"世界語","s":"________ was invented in 1887 to help people from different countries communicate, and today a few thousand families still speak it at home.","zh":"世界語於 1887 年被發明出來，以幫助不同國家的人溝通，而如今仍有幾千個家庭在家中使用它。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A195","t":"世界語"},{"w":"constructed language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a language that someone designed on purpose","cn":"人造語言","s":"Klingon is a ______ ______ from Star Trek, but some fans have learned it so well that they can hold whole conversations.","zh":"克林貢語是來自《星艦迷航記》的人造語言，但有些粉絲學得非常好，能進行完整的對話。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A196","t":"人造語言"},{"w":"speech community","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a group of people who share a language or way of speaking","cn":"言語社群","s":"Gamers form their own ______ ______ online, so outsiders often cannot understand their fast messages full of special terms.","zh":"玩家在網路上形成自己的言語社群，所以外人常常看不懂他們充滿專門術語的快速訊息。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A197","t":"言語社群"},{"w":"language planning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"deliberate efforts to manage how languages are used","cn":"語言規劃","s":"After independence the country needed careful ______ ______, because people spoke more than twenty languages and needed one for schools.","zh":"獨立後這個國家需要謹慎的語言規劃，因為人們說二十多種語言，而學校需要一種共同語言。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A198","t":"語言規劃"},{"w":"vernacular","pos":"n.","def":"the everyday language spoken by ordinary people","cn":"日常用語；方言白話","s":"The priest began to preach in the ________ instead of Latin, so ordinary villagers could finally understand his message.","zh":"那位神父開始用白話而非拉丁文佈道，所以一般村民終於能聽懂他的訊息。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A199","t":"白話"},{"w":"language rights","pos":"n.phr.","def":"people's right to use their own language","cn":"語言權","s":"Indigenous groups are fighting for ______ ______, so they can use their own languages in courts, hospitals and schools.","zh":"原住民族群正在爭取語言權，以便他們能在法院、醫院和學校使用自己的語言。","part":"A","sec":"World Languages & Language Change 世界語言與語言變遷","lab":"A200","t":"語言權"},{"w":"accessibility","pos":"n.","def":"how easy something is to reach, use or understand","cn":"可及性；易用性","s":"The museum improved the ________ of its website, so blind visitors can now listen to every page with a screen reader.","zh":"博物館改善了網站的易用性，所以視障訪客現在能用螢幕閱讀器聆聽每一頁。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"易用性"},{"w":"advocacy","pos":"n.","def":"public support for an idea or group","cn":"倡議；提倡","s":"Her ________ for sign language helped deaf students, because the school finally hired two interpreters for its classes.","zh":"她對手語的倡議幫助了聽障學生，因為學校終於為課堂聘請了兩位口譯員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"倡議"},{"w":"allocation","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of something given for a purpose","cn":"分配；配額","s":"The school's budget ________ for language classes was cut, so the French club had to buy its own books.","zh":"學校給語言課程的預算分配被刪減了，所以法文社必須自己買書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"分配"},{"w":"amendment","pos":"n.","def":"a small change made to a law or document","cn":"修正案；修訂","s":"Parliament passed an ________ to the education law, and now every primary school must offer a local language.","zh":"國會通過了教育法的修正案，現在每所小學都必須開設一種本土語言課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"修正案"},{"w":"appendix","pos":"n.","def":"extra information at the end of a book or report","cn":"附錄","s":"The grammar book has a useful ________ of irregular verbs, so I check it whenever I am not sure about a past tense.","zh":"這本文法書有一份實用的不規則動詞附錄，所以每當我不確定過去式時就會查看它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"附錄"},{"w":"appreciation","pos":"n.","def":"understanding and enjoying the value of something","cn":"欣賞；體會","s":"Learning Japanese gave me a deeper ________ of anime, because I could finally catch the jokes that subtitles missed.","zh":"學日文讓我對動漫有更深的體會，因為我終於能聽懂字幕漏掉的笑話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"體會"},{"w":"assurance","pos":"n.","def":"a promise that makes someone feel confident","cn":"保證；擔保","s":"The company gave customers an ________ that every translation would be checked twice, so many hospitals chose its service.","zh":"這家公司向客戶保證每份翻譯都會檢查兩次，所以許多醫院選擇了它的服務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"保證"},{"w":"attribution","pos":"n.","def":"saying who wrote or created something","cn":"出處標明；歸屬","s":"You must give clear ________ when you use a quote from a book, or your essay may be marked as plagiarised.","zh":"當你引用書中的句子時必須清楚標明出處，否則你的文章可能被判定為抄襲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"標明出處"},{"w":"allegory","pos":"n.","def":"a story with a hidden moral or political meaning","cn":"寓言；諷喻","s":"Animal Farm looks like a story about pigs, but it is really an ________ about power, and students discuss it in class.","zh":"《動物農莊》看似一個關於豬的故事，但它其實是一則關於權力的寓言，學生們會在課堂上討論它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"寓言"},{"w":"allusion","pos":"n.","def":"an indirect mention of something","cn":"暗指；典故","s":"The speech contained an ________ to a famous Chinese poem, so the foreign guests needed the interpreter to explain it.","zh":"演講中包含了一個著名中國詩詞的典故，所以外國賓客需要口譯員解釋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"典故"},{"w":"anachronism","pos":"n.","def":"something placed in the wrong historical time","cn":"時代錯置","s":"The film about ancient Rome had an ________ in one scene, because a soldier was clearly wearing a wristwatch.","zh":"那部關於古羅馬的電影在某個場景中有時代錯置的錯誤，因為一名士兵明顯戴著手錶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"時代錯置"},{"w":"anecdote","pos":"n.","def":"a short interesting story about a real event","cn":"軼事；小故事","s":"The professor began with a funny ________ about getting lost in Paris, and everyone relaxed before the serious lecture.","zh":"教授以一個在巴黎迷路的好笑小故事開場，而大家在嚴肅的講座開始前都放鬆了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"小故事"},{"w":"antithesis","pos":"n.","def":"the exact opposite","cn":"正好相反；對立面","s":"His careless speaking style is the ________ of his sister's, because she plans every word before she opens her mouth.","zh":"他隨便的說話風格和他姊姊的正好相反，因為她開口前會規劃好每個字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"正好相反"},{"w":"approbation","pos":"n.","def":"approval or praise","cn":"讚許；認可","s":"The young translator won the ________ of the famous author, so her name now appears on the cover of the new edition.","zh":"這位年輕譯者贏得了知名作家的讚許，所以她的名字現在出現在新版的封面上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"讚許"},{"w":"arbiter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who judges what is right or correct","cn":"仲裁者；權威裁定者","s":"Many people treat the Oxford dictionary as the final ________ of correct English, but language keeps changing anyway.","zh":"許多人把牛津字典當作正確英文的最終裁定者，但語言無論如何都在不斷變化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"裁定者"},{"w":"assent","pos":"n.","def":"agreement or approval","cn":"同意；贊成","s":"The teacher nodded her ________, so we started recording our English podcast during the lunch break.","zh":"老師點頭表示同意，所以我們在午休時間開始錄製英文播客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"同意"},{"w":"candour","pos":"n.","def":"honest and open speech","cn":"坦率；直言","s":"I appreciated my tutor's ________ about my accent, because she told me exactly which sounds I needed to fix.","zh":"我很感謝家教對我口音的坦率，因為她準確告訴我哪些音需要改正。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"坦率"},{"w":"catharsis","pos":"n.","def":"a release of strong emotions that makes you feel better","cn":"情緒宣洩；淨化","s":"Writing a diary in English was a kind of ________ for her, because she could express feelings she could not say aloud.","zh":"用英文寫日記對她來說是一種情緒宣洩，因為她能表達說不出口的感受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"情緒宣洩"},{"w":"circumlocution","pos":"n.","def":"using many words when a few would do","cn":"拐彎抹角；迂迴說法","s":"When you forget a word, ________ can help you, so you might say \"the thing that opens doors\" instead of \"key\".","zh":"當你忘記一個字時，迂迴說法能幫助你，所以你可以說「開門的東西」而不是「鑰匙」。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"迂迴說法"},{"w":"compendium","pos":"n.","def":"a book with a lot of information on one subject","cn":"彙編；概要","s":"My uncle gave me a ________ of English idioms, and I read a few pages on the bus every morning.","zh":"我叔叔送我一本英文慣用語彙編，而我每天早上在公車上讀幾頁。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"彙編"},{"w":"decorum","pos":"n.","def":"polite and correct behaviour","cn":"禮節；端莊得體","s":"The students behaved with great ________ during the ceremony, but they started shouting and laughing as soon as it ended.","zh":"學生們在典禮中表現得非常得體，但典禮一結束他們就開始大叫大笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"得體"},{"w":"disdain","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling that something is not worth respect","cn":"鄙視；輕蔑","s":"Some people show ________ for text-message slang, but linguists see it as a creative new way of writing.","zh":"有些人對簡訊俚語表現出輕蔑，但語言學家把它看作一種有創意的新書寫方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"輕蔑"},{"w":"dissonance","pos":"n.","def":"a lack of agreement or harmony","cn":"不和諧；不一致","s":"There was a clear ________ between the minister's words and his actions, so voters stopped believing his promises.","zh":"部長的言行之間有明顯的不一致，所以選民不再相信他的承諾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"不一致"},{"w":"duplicity","pos":"n.","def":"dishonest behaviour meant to trick people","cn":"欺騙；口是心非","s":"The salesman's ________ shocked us, because he said the phone was new while he knew it had been repaired.","zh":"那位推銷員的欺騙行為讓我們震驚，因為他明知手機修過卻說是全新的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"欺騙行為"},{"w":"eulogy","pos":"n.","def":"a speech praising someone who has died","cn":"悼詞","s":"My cousin gave a moving ________ at our grandfather's funeral, and she spoke in both Hakka and Mandarin.","zh":"我表姊在爺爺的葬禮上發表了一篇感人的悼詞，而且她用客家話和國語兩種語言說。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"悼詞"},{"w":"foible","pos":"n.","def":"a small weakness in someone's character","cn":"小缺點；怪癖","s":"Correcting everyone's grammar is my teacher's only ________, but we forgive her because she is so kind.","zh":"糾正每個人的文法是我們老師唯一的小怪癖，但我們原諒她，因為她人非常好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"小怪癖"},{"w":"guile","pos":"n.","def":"clever but dishonest behaviour","cn":"狡詐；詭計","s":"The fox in the story uses ________ to steal the crow's cheese, so the lesson is to be careful of people who flatter you.","zh":"故事中的狐狸用詭計偷走了烏鴉的起司，所以寓意是要小心奉承你的人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"詭計"},{"w":"heresy","pos":"n.","def":"an idea that strongly opposes accepted beliefs","cn":"異端邪說","s":"Splitting an infinitive was once seen as ________ by grammar teachers, but most writers today think it is perfectly fine.","zh":"拆開不定詞曾被文法老師視為異端，但現今大多數作家認為這完全沒問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"異端"},{"w":"hubris","pos":"n.","def":"too much pride and self-confidence","cn":"傲慢；狂妄自大","s":"The student's ________ led him to skip revision, because he believed his English was perfect, but he failed the writing test.","zh":"那名學生的狂妄自大讓他略過複習，因為他相信自己的英文完美無缺，但他寫作測驗不及格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"狂妄自大"},{"w":"iconoclast","pos":"n.","def":"a person who attacks traditional ideas","cn":"反傳統者；打破舊習的人","s":"The poet was an ________ who ignored punctuation rules, and young readers loved her daring style.","zh":"這位詩人是一個反傳統的人，她無視標點符號規則，而年輕讀者喜愛她大膽的風格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"反傳統的人"},{"w":"levity","pos":"n.","def":"humour in a serious situation","cn":"輕鬆幽默；輕率","s":"A little ________ helped the nervous candidates, so the examiner told a short joke before the speaking test began.","zh":"一點輕鬆幽默幫助了緊張的考生，所以考官在口說測驗開始前講了個小笑話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"輕鬆幽默"},{"w":"maverick","pos":"n.","def":"a person who thinks and acts independently","cn":"特立獨行的人","s":"The new teacher was a ________ who taught grammar through rap songs, and the students' scores rose quickly.","zh":"新老師是個特立獨行的人，他透過饒舌歌教文法，而學生的成績迅速提高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"特立獨行的人"},{"w":"neophyte","pos":"n.","def":"a beginner","cn":"新手；初學者","s":"As a ________ in Korean, I could only say hello and thank you, but the shop owners still smiled and helped me.","zh":"身為韓文初學者，我只會說你好和謝謝，但店主們還是微笑著幫助我。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"初學者"},{"w":"nostalgia","pos":"n.","def":"a happy but sad feeling about the past","cn":"懷舊；思鄉之情","s":"Hearing her hometown dialect filled her with ________, because it reminded her of summers at her grandmother's house.","zh":"聽到家鄉的方言讓她充滿懷舊之情，因為那讓她想起在外婆家度過的夏天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"懷舊之情"},{"w":"paragon","pos":"n.","def":"a perfect example of a quality","cn":"典範；模範","s":"Our principal is a ________ of patience, because she listens to every student calmly even when they are shouting.","zh":"我們校長是耐心的典範，因為即使學生大吼大叫，她也會冷靜地聆聽每個人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"典範"},{"w":"pariah","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is rejected by others","cn":"被排斥的人；棄兒","s":"After he posted rude comments online, the singer became a ________, and many fans stopped buying his music.","zh":"在網上發布無禮留言後，這位歌手成了被排斥的人，許多粉絲不再買他的音樂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"被排斥的人"},{"w":"predilection","pos":"n.","def":"a strong liking for something","cn":"偏好；偏愛","s":"The author has a ________ for long sentences, so translators often have to split them into shorter ones in Chinese.","zh":"這位作家偏好長句子，所以譯者常常必須在中文裡把它們拆成較短的句子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"偏好"},{"w":"probity","pos":"n.","def":"complete honesty","cn":"正直；誠實","s":"Interpreters must show great ________, because they hear secret information and must never share it with anyone.","zh":"口譯員必須展現高度的正直，因為他們會聽到機密資訊，而且絕不能與任何人分享。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"正直"},{"w":"protagonist","pos":"n.","def":"the main character in a story","cn":"主角","s":"The ________ of the novel is a young interpreter, and the story follows her life during the war.","zh":"這部小說的主角是一位年輕的口譯員，而故事描寫她在戰爭期間的生活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"主角"},{"w":"rancour","pos":"n.","def":"long-lasting anger and bitterness","cn":"積怨；怨恨","s":"The two writers argued for years, but there was no ________ between them, because they still respected each other's work.","zh":"兩位作家爭論了好幾年，但他們之間沒有怨恨，因為他們仍然尊重彼此的作品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"怨恨"},{"w":"veneer","pos":"n.","def":"a thin outer appearance that hides the truth","cn":"虛飾；表面","s":"Under a ________ of politeness, the letter was actually very angry, and the translator worked hard to keep that hidden tone.","zh":"在禮貌的表面下，這封信其實非常憤怒，而譯者努力保留那種隱藏的語氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"表面"},{"w":"sycophant","pos":"n.","def":"a person who praises powerful people to get advantages","cn":"諂媚者；馬屁精","s":"The manager was surrounded by ________ who agreed with every idea, so nobody warned him about the bad translation.","zh":"經理身邊圍繞著什麼想法都附和的馬屁精，所以沒有人提醒他那份翻譯很糟。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"馬屁精"},{"w":"globalisation","pos":"n.","def":"the process of the world becoming more connected","cn":"全球化","s":"________ has made English more useful, but it has also put pressure on many small local languages.","zh":"全球化讓英文變得更有用，但也對許多當地的小語種造成壓力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"全球化"},{"w":"admissible","pos":"adj.","def":"allowed or accepted, especially in court","cn":"可被接受的；可採納的","s":"The recording was not ________ in court, because the translation had not been checked by an official interpreter.","zh":"那段錄音在法庭上不可被採納，因為翻譯沒有經過官方口譯員檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"不可被採納"},{"w":"affable","pos":"adj.","def":"friendly and easy to talk to","cn":"和藹可親的","s":"The ________ shopkeeper chatted with us in slow English, so even my little brother felt brave enough to answer.","zh":"那位和藹可親的店主用慢速的英文和我們聊天，所以連我弟弟都有勇氣回答。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"和藹可親的"},{"w":"amiable","pos":"adj.","def":"pleasant and friendly","cn":"友善的；親切的","s":"My host father was an ________ man who corrected my mistakes gently, and he never made me feel stupid.","zh":"我的寄宿爸爸是個親切的人，他溫和地糾正我的錯誤，從不讓我覺得自己很笨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"親切的"},{"w":"amicable","pos":"adj.","def":"friendly and without arguments","cn":"友好的；和睦的","s":"The two companies reached an ________ agreement, so the translation project continued without any lawyers.","zh":"兩家公司達成了友好的協議，所以翻譯計畫在沒有律師介入的情況下繼續進行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"友好的"},{"w":"apposite","pos":"adj.","def":"very suitable for the situation","cn":"恰當的；貼切的","s":"She closed her speech with an ________ proverb, and the audience clapped because it matched the topic perfectly.","zh":"她用一句貼切的諺語結束演講，觀眾都鼓掌了，因為它完美地呼應了主題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"貼切的"},{"w":"authoritarian","pos":"adj.","def":"demanding total obedience","cn":"專制的；獨裁的","s":"The ________ government banned books in minority languages, but families kept teaching their children at home in secret.","zh":"專制的政府禁止少數語言的書籍，但家庭們仍在家中秘密地教孩子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"專制的"},{"w":"banal","pos":"adj.","def":"ordinary and boring","cn":"陳腐的；平淡無奇的","s":"The song's lyrics were ________, but the melody was so catchy that it became a hit anyway.","zh":"這首歌的歌詞平淡無奇，但旋律非常好記，所以它還是紅了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"平淡無奇"},{"w":"bemused","pos":"adj.","def":"confused and puzzled","cn":"困惑的","s":"The tourist looked ________ when the waiter answered in fast Taiwanese, so I explained the menu to him in English.","zh":"當服務生用快速的台語回答時，那位觀光客看起來很困惑，所以我用英文為他解釋菜單。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"困惑"},{"w":"bilateral","pos":"adj.","def":"involving two groups or countries","cn":"雙邊的","s":"The two countries signed a ________ agreement, so students can now study the other country's language with free scholarships.","zh":"兩國簽署了一項雙邊協議，所以學生現在能獲得免費獎學金去學習對方國家的語言。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"雙邊"},{"w":"bombastic","pos":"adj.","def":"using big words to sound important","cn":"浮誇的；誇大其詞的","s":"His essay was full of ________ language, but the teacher said simple and clear words would have been much better.","zh":"他的文章充滿浮誇的語言，但老師說簡單清楚的字會好得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"浮誇的"},{"w":"bona fide","pos":"adj.","def":"real and genuine","cn":"真正的；真誠的","s":"Only ______ ______ students can get the discount, so you must show your student card at the language centre.","zh":"只有真正的學生才能享有折扣，所以你必須在語言中心出示學生證。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"真正的"},{"w":"brusque","pos":"adj.","def":"short and rude in speech","cn":"唐突的；粗魯簡短的","s":"The officer's ________ reply upset the tourist, but maybe he was just tired and not good at English.","zh":"那位官員粗魯簡短的回答讓觀光客不高興，但也許他只是累了，而且英文不好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"粗魯簡短的"},{"w":"caustic","pos":"adj.","def":"very critical in a cruel way","cn":"刻薄的；尖酸的","s":"The critic wrote a ________ review of the translation, but readers still loved the book and bought thousands of copies.","zh":"那位評論家對譯本寫了一篇尖酸刻薄的評論，但讀者仍然喜愛這本書，買了好幾千本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"尖酸刻薄的"},{"w":"conciliatory","pos":"adj.","def":"trying to end an argument and make peace","cn":"安撫的；和解的","s":"After the argument, he sent a ________ message in Chinese and English, so his friend finally agreed to talk again.","zh":"爭吵後，他用中英文發了一則和解的訊息，所以他朋友終於同意再談一談。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"和解的"},{"w":"congruent","pos":"adj.","def":"matching or in agreement with something","cn":"一致的；相符的","s":"Your body language should be ________ with your words, because a smile with angry words confuses the listener.","zh":"你的肢體語言應該和你說的話一致，因為帶著微笑說生氣的話會讓聽者困惑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"一致"},{"w":"contemptuous","pos":"adj.","def":"showing no respect","cn":"輕視的；鄙夷的","s":"He gave a ________ laugh when I made a grammar mistake, so I decided to practise with a kinder partner.","zh":"我犯文法錯誤時他發出輕蔑的笑聲，所以我決定和一位更友善的夥伴練習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"輕蔑的"},{"w":"convoluted","pos":"adj.","def":"very complicated and hard to follow","cn":"錯綜複雜的；費解的","s":"The instructions were so ________ that nobody could follow them, so the company rewrote them in plain English.","zh":"那些說明複雜難懂到沒人能照著做，所以公司用淺白的英文重寫了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"複雜難懂"},{"w":"credulous","pos":"adj.","def":"too ready to believe things","cn":"輕信的；易受騙的","s":"My ________ little sister believed that eating carrots would help her speak French, and she ate five that day.","zh":"我那容易輕信的妹妹相信吃紅蘿蔔能幫助她說法文，結果她那天吃了五根。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"容易輕信的"},{"w":"deft","pos":"adj.","def":"quick and skilful","cn":"靈巧的；熟練的","s":"The interpreter made a ________ change to the joke, so the Chinese audience laughed at exactly the right moment.","zh":"口譯員對那個笑話做了巧妙的改動，所以中文觀眾在恰當的時刻笑了出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"巧妙的"},{"w":"diffident","pos":"adj.","def":"shy and lacking confidence","cn":"缺乏自信的；羞怯的","s":"She was ________ about speaking English at first, but the friendly class helped her become one of the most active students.","zh":"她一開始對說英文缺乏自信，但友善的班級幫助她成為最活躍的學生之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"缺乏自信"},{"w":"diminutive","pos":"adj.","def":"very small","cn":"極小的；矮小的","s":"The ________ girl had a surprisingly loud voice, so she won the school speech contest without a microphone.","zh":"那個嬌小的女孩有著驚人的大嗓門，所以她沒用麥克風就贏得了學校演講比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"嬌小的"},{"w":"effusive","pos":"adj.","def":"showing a lot of feeling, especially praise","cn":"熱情洋溢的；過分熱情的","s":"The author sent the translator an ________ thank-you letter, and she hung it on the wall above her desk.","zh":"作家寄給譯者一封熱情洋溢的感謝信，而她把信掛在書桌上方的牆上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"熱情洋溢的"},{"w":"elated","pos":"adj.","def":"very happy and excited","cn":"興高采烈的","s":"I was ________ when I got band 7 in IELTS, so I called my parents right away and we went out for dinner.","zh":"我雅思考到 7 分時欣喜若狂，所以我馬上打電話給爸媽，然後我們出去吃晚餐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"欣喜若狂"},{"w":"facetious","pos":"adj.","def":"joking at the wrong time","cn":"開玩笑的；不正經的","s":"His ________ comment during the serious budget meeting annoyed the boss, so he apologised to her later that afternoon.","zh":"他在嚴肅的預算會議中說了一句不正經的話惹惱了老闆，所以他那天下午稍晚向她道歉了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"不正經的"},{"w":"fickle","pos":"adj.","def":"changing your mind often","cn":"善變的","s":"Teenagers can be ________ about slang, so a word that is cool this month may sound silly next year.","zh":"青少年對俚語可能很善變，所以這個月很酷的字明年可能聽起來很蠢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"善變"},{"w":"furtive","pos":"adj.","def":"secret and trying not to be noticed","cn":"偷偷摸摸的","s":"The student took a ________ look at his phone dictionary, but the examiner noticed and took it away.","zh":"那名學生偷偷摸摸地看了一眼手機字典，但考官注意到並把它拿走了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"偷偷摸摸地"},{"w":"garrulous","pos":"adj.","def":"talking too much about unimportant things","cn":"喋喋不休的","s":"The ________ taxi driver talked for the whole trip, but it was great listening practice for my Spanish.","zh":"那位喋喋不休的計程車司機整趟車程都在說話，但這對我的西班牙文是很好的聽力練習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"喋喋不休的"},{"w":"glib","pos":"adj.","def":"speaking easily but without thinking carefully","cn":"油嘴滑舌的；隨口說的","s":"The politician gave a ________ answer about education, so reporters asked him again for real details.","zh":"那位政治人物對教育問題給了一個隨口敷衍的回答，所以記者再次追問具體細節。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"隨口敷衍的"},{"w":"hackneyed","pos":"adj.","def":"used so often that it is no longer interesting","cn":"陳腔濫調的","s":"\"At the end of the day\" is a ________ phrase, so try to find fresher words in your IELTS essay.","zh":"「At the end of the day」是一個陳腔濫調的片語，所以在你的雅思作文中試著找更新鮮的字詞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"陳腔濫調的"},{"w":"haughty","pos":"adj.","def":"proud and unfriendly to others","cn":"傲慢的","s":"The ________ waiter laughed at my French pronunciation, but the chef came out and kindly helped me order.","zh":"那位傲慢的服務生嘲笑我的法文發音，但主廚走出來親切地幫我點餐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"傲慢的"},{"w":"impassive","pos":"adj.","def":"showing no emotion","cn":"面無表情的","s":"The interpreter kept an ________ face during the angry speech, because her job was to translate, not to react.","zh":"口譯員在那場憤怒的演講中保持面無表情，因為她的工作是翻譯，而不是做出反應。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"面無表情"},{"w":"impertinent","pos":"adj.","def":"rude and not showing respect","cn":"無禮的；不禮貌的","s":"Asking someone's salary can seem ________ in English-speaking countries, so it is better to avoid that question.","zh":"在英語系國家詢問別人的薪水可能顯得無禮，所以最好避免那個問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"無禮"},{"w":"implacable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to calm or change","cn":"無法平息的；毫不妥協的","s":"The teacher was ________ about mobile phones, so any phone seen during the test was taken away until Friday.","zh":"老師對手機毫不妥協，所以考試中被看到的任何手機都會被沒收到星期五。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"毫不妥協"},{"w":"inane","pos":"adj.","def":"silly and without meaning","cn":"愚蠢的；空洞的","s":"The chatbot gave an ________ answer to my question, so I checked a real grammar book instead.","zh":"聊天機器人對我的問題給了一個空洞的回答，所以我改去查一本真正的文法書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"空洞的"},{"w":"incoherent","pos":"adj.","def":"not clear or easy to understand","cn":"語無倫次的；不連貫的","s":"He was so tired after the flight that his speech was ________, so we let him sleep before asking any more questions.","zh":"他飛行後非常疲累，說話語無倫次，所以我們讓他先睡覺再問更多問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"語無倫次"},{"w":"incorrigible","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to be changed or improved","cn":"無可救藥的；積習難改的","s":"My brother is an ________ joker, so even during serious family dinners he keeps making silly puns.","zh":"我弟弟是個無可救藥的愛開玩笑者，所以即使在嚴肅的家庭晚餐上他也一直講冷雙關語。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"無可救藥的"},{"w":"incredulous","pos":"adj.","def":"not able to believe something","cn":"不相信的；懷疑的","s":"My friends were ________ when I said I had learned Korean in one year, so I spoke to them in Korean to prove it.","zh":"當我說我一年就學會韓文時，朋友們都不敢相信，所以我用韓文跟他們說話來證明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"不敢相信"},{"w":"indefatigable","pos":"adj.","def":"never getting tired","cn":"不知疲倦的","s":"The ________ volunteer taught Chinese to refugees every evening, and she still came to work early the next morning.","zh":"那位不知疲倦的志工每天晚上教難民中文，而且隔天早上仍然提早上班。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"不知疲倦的"},{"w":"ineffable","pos":"adj.","def":"too great to be described in words","cn":"難以言喻的","s":"Standing on the mountain at sunrise gave me an ________ feeling, so I just stayed quiet and took no photos.","zh":"日出時站在山上給了我一種難以言喻的感覺，所以我只是靜靜地待著，沒有拍照。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"難以言喻的"},{"w":"infallible","pos":"adj.","def":"never wrong","cn":"絕對正確的；萬無一失的","s":"Translation apps are useful but not ________, so you should check important documents with a real person.","zh":"翻譯應用程式很有用但並非萬無一失，所以重要文件應該找真人確認。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"萬無一失"},{"w":"ingenuous","pos":"adj.","def":"innocent and trusting","cn":"天真的；坦率的","s":"The child's ________ question about why adults lie made everyone at the table laugh, but it also made us think.","zh":"那孩子問大人為什麼說謊這個天真的問題讓餐桌上的每個人都笑了，但也讓我們陷入思考。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"天真的"},{"w":"inscrutable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to understand or read","cn":"難以理解的；高深莫測的","s":"The professor's ________ smile made us nervous, because we could not tell whether she liked our presentation.","zh":"教授高深莫測的微笑讓我們很緊張，因為我們看不出她是否喜歡我們的報告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"高深莫測的"},{"w":"insipid","pos":"adj.","def":"without interest or flavour","cn":"乏味的；枯燥的","s":"The textbook dialogues were ________, so our teacher used real TV clips, and the class became much more lively.","zh":"課本裡的對話很乏味，所以老師改用真實的電視片段，而課堂變得生動多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"乏味"},{"w":"intransigent","pos":"adj.","def":"refusing to change your opinion","cn":"不妥協的；固執己見的","s":"The two sides were ________ about the name of the new language school, so the meeting went on for four hours.","zh":"雙方對新語言學校的名稱互不讓步，所以會議進行了四個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"互不讓步"},{"w":"irreverent","pos":"adj.","def":"not showing respect for serious things","cn":"不敬的；調侃的","s":"The comedian's ________ jokes about grammar teachers were very popular, although a few teachers in the audience were not amused.","zh":"那位喜劇演員對文法老師的調侃笑話很受歡迎，雖然觀眾中有幾位老師並不覺得好笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"調侃"},{"w":"jocular","pos":"adj.","def":"funny and joking","cn":"詼諧的；愛開玩笑的","s":"Our principal gave a ________ speech at graduation, so the parents laughed and the nervous students relaxed.","zh":"我們校長在畢業典禮上發表了一篇詼諧的演講，所以家長們笑了，緊張的學生也放鬆了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"詼諧的"},{"w":"laconic","pos":"adj.","def":"using very few words","cn":"簡潔的；寡言的","s":"My grandfather is ________ and usually answers with one word, but he tells long stories when he talks about his childhood.","zh":"我爺爺話很少，通常只回答一個字，但談起童年時他會講很長的故事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"話很少"},{"w":"luminous","pos":"adj.","def":"very bright or clear","cn":"發光的；明亮清晰的","s":"Critics praised the ________ prose of the translation, because every sentence felt as clear and bright as the original.","zh":"評論家讚揚譯本清澈明亮的文筆，因為每個句子都感覺和原著一樣清晰明亮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"清澈明亮的"},{"w":"magnanimous","pos":"adj.","def":"kind and generous, especially to a rival","cn":"寬宏大量的","s":"The champion was ________ after the debate, so she praised her opponent's arguments and shook hands warmly.","zh":"冠軍在辯論賽後寬宏大量，她稱讚對手的論點並熱情地握手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"寬宏大量"},{"w":"malevolent","pos":"adj.","def":"wanting to harm others","cn":"惡毒的；懷有惡意的","s":"The ________ character in the story spreads lies in every village, but a young girl finally reveals the truth.","zh":"故事中那個惡毒的角色在每個村莊散布謊言，但一個年輕女孩最終揭露了真相。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"惡毒的"},{"w":"mendacious","pos":"adj.","def":"not telling the truth","cn":"說謊的；虛假的","s":"The advertisement made ________ claims about learning English in a week, so many parents complained to the government.","zh":"那則廣告做出一週學會英文的虛假聲明，所以許多家長向政府投訴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"虛假"},{"w":"mercurial","pos":"adj.","def":"changing mood quickly and suddenly","cn":"反覆無常的","s":"The director had a ________ temper, so the actors never knew whether he would laugh or shout at them.","zh":"導演的脾氣反覆無常，所以演員們永遠不知道他會笑還是對他們大吼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"反覆無常"},{"w":"morose","pos":"adj.","def":"unhappy and quiet","cn":"悶悶不樂的","s":"He was ________ after failing the speaking test, but his teacher encouraged him, and he passed on his second try.","zh":"他口說測驗不及格後悶悶不樂，但老師鼓勵他，而他第二次就通過了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"悶悶不樂"},{"w":"nebulous","pos":"adj.","def":"unclear and not well defined","cn":"模糊的；含糊不清的","s":"His plan to \"improve English\" was too ________, so his tutor asked him to set a clear goal for each week.","zh":"他「提升英文」的計畫太模糊了，所以家教要求他為每週設定一個明確的目標。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"模糊"},{"w":"nonchalant","pos":"adj.","def":"calm and not worried","cn":"若無其事的；漫不經心的","s":"She looked ________ before the interview, but she told me later that her hands were shaking under the table.","zh":"她面試前看起來若無其事，但她後來告訴我，她的手在桌子底下發抖。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"若無其事"},{"w":"obsequious","pos":"adj.","def":"too eager to please or obey","cn":"諂媚的；奉承的","s":"The ________ assistant agreed with everything the director said, so the bad ideas were never questioned.","zh":"那位諂媚的助理附和導演說的每件事，所以那些糟糕的想法從未受到質疑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"諂媚的"},{"w":"obtuse","pos":"adj.","def":"slow to understand","cn":"遲鈍的","s":"I felt ________ when I missed the joke in English, but my friend kindly explained the wordplay to me.","zh":"當我沒聽懂英文笑話時覺得自己很遲鈍，但朋友親切地向我解釋了那個文字遊戲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"遲鈍"},{"w":"ostentatious","pos":"adj.","def":"showing off wealth or knowledge","cn":"炫耀的；招搖的","s":"He used ________ words in every sentence to impress people, but most listeners just found him hard to understand.","zh":"他每句話都用炫耀式的艱深字詞來給人留下印象，但大多數聽眾只覺得他很難懂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"炫耀式的"},{"w":"petulant","pos":"adj.","def":"childishly bad-tempered","cn":"任性的；暴躁的","s":"The ________ boy threw his workbook on the floor, because he did not want to practise spelling any more.","zh":"那個任性的男孩把作業簿丟到地上，因為他不想再練習拼字了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"任性的"},{"w":"poignant","pos":"adj.","def":"making you feel sad and moved","cn":"令人心酸的；感人的","s":"The film ends with a ________ letter from a soldier to his mother, and many people in the cinema started to cry.","zh":"這部電影以一封士兵寫給母親的感人信件作結，而電影院裡許多人開始哭泣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"感人"},{"w":"presumptuous","pos":"adj.","def":"doing something without the right or permission","cn":"冒昧的；放肆的","s":"It may seem ________ to call your professor by her first name, so wait until she invites you to do it.","zh":"直接叫教授的名字可能顯得冒昧，所以要等她邀請你這麼做。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"冒昧"},{"w":"prosaic","pos":"adj.","def":"ordinary and without imagination","cn":"平凡乏味的","s":"The poem was translated into ________ language, so the beautiful images of the original were lost.","zh":"這首詩被翻譯成平淡無奇的語言，所以原作中美麗的意象都消失了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"平淡無奇的"},{"w":"provincial","pos":"adj.","def":"narrow-minded and not interested in the wider world","cn":"眼界狹隘的；鄉土的","s":"Travelling abroad made her less ________, because she learned that many cultures see the world differently.","zh":"出國旅行讓她變得不那麼眼界狹隘，因為她了解到許多文化以不同方式看世界。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"眼界狹隘"},{"w":"punctilious","pos":"adj.","def":"very careful about details and rules","cn":"一絲不苟的","s":"The editor is ________ about commas, so she checks every page twice before the book goes to print.","zh":"那位編輯對逗號一絲不苟，所以書付印前她會把每一頁檢查兩次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"一絲不苟"},{"w":"raucous","pos":"adj.","def":"loud and rough","cn":"喧鬧的；刺耳的","s":"The ________ crowd at the night market made it hard to hear, so we had to shout our orders at the food stall.","zh":"夜市喧鬧的人群讓人很難聽清楚，所以我們必須在小吃攤大聲喊出點餐內容。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"喧鬧的"},{"w":"recalcitrant","pos":"adj.","def":"refusing to obey or cooperate","cn":"頑抗的；不聽話的","s":"The ________ printer refused to work all morning, so we had to hand in our essays by email instead.","zh":"那台不聽使喚的印表機整個早上都不肯運作，所以我們只好改用電子郵件交作文。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"不聽使喚的"},{"w":"replete","pos":"adj.","def":"full of something","cn":"充滿的","s":"Shakespeare's plays are ________ with expressions we still use, like \"break the ice\" and \"wild-goose chase\".","zh":"莎士比亞的戲劇充滿我們至今仍在使用的說法，例如「break the ice」和「wild-goose chase」。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"充滿"},{"w":"reprehensible","pos":"adj.","def":"very bad and deserving blame","cn":"應受譴責的","s":"Copying a classmate's translation is ________, so the teacher gave both students a zero and called their parents.","zh":"抄襲同學的翻譯是應受譴責的，所以老師給兩名學生零分，並打電話給他們的家長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"應受譴責的"},{"w":"sanguine","pos":"adj.","def":"hopeful and positive","cn":"樂觀的","s":"The coach is ________ about the team's chances, but the players know they still need to train hard every day.","zh":"教練對球隊的勝算很樂觀，但球員們知道他們每天仍需努力訓練。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"樂觀"},{"w":"sardonic","pos":"adj.","def":"mocking in a cold, unkind way","cn":"嘲諷的；冷嘲熱諷的","s":"He gave a ________ smile when I mispronounced the word, so I felt embarrassed and stopped speaking.","zh":"我唸錯那個字時他露出嘲諷的微笑，所以我覺得很尷尬，就不再說話了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"嘲諷的"},{"w":"stoic","pos":"adj.","def":"calm and not complaining in hard times","cn":"堅忍的；淡然處之的","s":"She stayed ________ when her luggage was lost, and she calmly explained the problem in English to the airport staff.","zh":"她的行李遺失時仍保持淡定，並冷靜地用英文向機場人員說明問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"淡定"},{"w":"strident","pos":"adj.","def":"loud, harsh and forceful","cn":"刺耳的；強硬的","s":"The protesters made ________ demands for bilingual road signs, and the city finally agreed to change them.","zh":"抗議者強硬地要求設置雙語路標，而市政府最後同意更換。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"強硬地"},{"w":"sublime","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely beautiful or excellent","cn":"崇高的；絕妙的","s":"The singer's voice was ________, so even people who did not understand Italian had tears in their eyes.","zh":"那位歌手的嗓音美妙絕倫，所以即使不懂義大利文的人也眼含淚水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"美妙絕倫"},{"w":"subservient","pos":"adj.","def":"too willing to obey others","cn":"卑躬屈膝的；順從的","s":"In the old story the servant is always ________, but the modern film shows him as brave and independent.","zh":"在舊故事中那位僕人總是卑躬屈膝，但現代電影把他描繪成勇敢又獨立的人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"卑躬屈膝"},{"w":"surreptitious","pos":"adj.","def":"done secretly","cn":"偷偷的；暗中的","s":"He made a ________ recording of the lecture, but the professor saw the phone and asked him to delete it.","zh":"他偷偷地錄下講座內容，但教授看到手機並要求他刪除。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"偷偷地"},{"w":"taciturn","pos":"adj.","def":"not saying much","cn":"沉默寡言的","s":"My ________ classmate rarely speaks in class, but his written English is the best in our year.","zh":"我那位沉默寡言的同學很少在課堂上說話，但他的英文寫作是我們年級最好的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"沉默寡言的"},{"w":"tangential","pos":"adj.","def":"only slightly connected to the main topic","cn":"離題的；關係不大的","s":"His answer was ________ to the question, so the examiner reminded him to focus on what was asked.","zh":"他的回答和問題關係不大，所以考官提醒他專注在被問的內容上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"關係不大"},{"w":"terse","pos":"adj.","def":"very short and a little unfriendly","cn":"簡短生硬的","s":"My manager sent a ________ reply that only said \"Fix it\", so I wasn't sure whether she was angry.","zh":"我的主管回了一則簡短生硬的訊息，只寫著「修好它」，所以我不確定她是否生氣了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"簡短生硬的"},{"w":"transitory","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting only a short time","cn":"短暫的","s":"Many slang words are ________, and expressions that were popular ten years ago now sound very old-fashioned.","zh":"許多俚語是短暫的，十年前流行的說法現在聽起來非常過時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"短暫的"},{"w":"trenchant","pos":"adj.","def":"clear, strong and direct in criticism","cn":"一針見血的；尖銳的","s":"The editor's ________ comments improved my article, although they hurt my feelings when I first read them.","zh":"編輯一針見血的意見改善了我的文章，雖然我第一次讀時有點受傷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"一針見血的"},{"w":"unassuming","pos":"adj.","def":"modest and not wanting attention","cn":"謙遜的；不張揚的","s":"The ________ old man in our neighbourhood never talks about himself, but he turned out to be a famous translator of Russian novels.","zh":"我們社區裡那位不張揚的老先生從不談論自己，但他原來是一位知名的俄文小說譯者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"不張揚的"},{"w":"urbane","pos":"adj.","def":"polite, confident and comfortable in social situations","cn":"溫文爾雅的","s":"The ________ host made every guest feel welcome, and he switched easily between English, French and Chinese.","zh":"那位溫文儒雅的主人讓每位客人都感到受歡迎，而且他能輕鬆地在英文、法文和中文之間切換。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"溫文儒雅的"},{"w":"vapid","pos":"adj.","def":"boring and empty of ideas","cn":"空洞乏味的","s":"The talk show was full of ________ chat about celebrities, so I switched to a documentary instead.","zh":"那個脫口秀充滿了關於名人的空洞乏味的閒聊，所以我轉台去看紀錄片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"空洞乏味的"},{"w":"vicarious","pos":"adj.","def":"felt by watching or reading about others","cn":"間接體驗的；感同身受的","s":"Reading travel blogs gives me ________ pleasure, because I can explore Peru without leaving my bedroom.","zh":"閱讀旅遊部落格帶給我間接體驗的樂趣，因為我不用離開臥室就能探索秘魯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"間接體驗的"},{"w":"virulent","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely strong, harmful or full of hate","cn":"猛烈的；惡毒的","s":"The singer received ________ attacks online, but she replied calmly and asked her fans to be kind.","zh":"那位歌手在網路上遭受惡毒的攻擊，但她冷靜地回應，並請粉絲們保持善意。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"惡毒的"},{"w":"vitriolic","pos":"adj.","def":"full of bitter, angry criticism","cn":"尖酸刻薄的","s":"The ________ letter to the newspaper attacked the new language policy, but the editor still decided to print it.","zh":"那封寫給報社的尖酸刻薄的信抨擊新的語言政策，但編輯仍決定刊登。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"尖酸刻薄的"},{"w":"whimsical","pos":"adj.","def":"playful and unusual","cn":"異想天開的；古怪有趣的","s":"The children's book has a ________ style, so the translator invented new silly words to keep the fun in Chinese.","zh":"這本童書有一種古怪有趣的風格，所以譯者創造了新的傻氣字詞來保留中文版的趣味。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"古怪有趣的"},{"w":"wistful","pos":"adj.","def":"sadly wishing for something","cn":"惆悵的；渴望的","s":"My grandmother gave a ________ smile when she heard the old song, because it reminded her of her school days.","zh":"奶奶聽到那首老歌時露出惆悵的微笑，因為那讓她想起了學生時代。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"惆悵的"},{"w":"intercultural","pos":"adj.","def":"between different cultures","cn":"跨文化的","s":"The exchange programme improves ________ skills, so students learn how to work with people who have very different habits.","zh":"這個交換計畫能提升跨文化能力，所以學生學會如何與習慣非常不同的人合作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"跨文化"},{"w":"cross-cultural","pos":"adj.","def":"involving two or more cultures","cn":"跨文化的","s":"Eye contact can cause ________ misunderstandings, because it seems polite in some countries but rude in others.","zh":"眼神接觸可能造成跨文化的誤解，因為它在某些國家顯得禮貌，在其他國家卻顯得無禮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"跨文化的"},{"w":"expressive","pos":"adj.","def":"showing feelings clearly","cn":"富有表現力的","s":"Italian speakers are often very ________ with their hands, so you can sometimes guess their meaning without words.","zh":"說義大利語的人常常用手勢表達得很生動，所以有時不用言語你也能猜出他們的意思。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"表達得很生動"},{"w":"parochial","pos":"adj.","def":"only interested in your own small area","cn":"狹隘的；地方性的","s":"His views on language were rather ________, but living abroad for a year opened his mind to new ideas.","zh":"他對語言的看法相當狹隘，但在國外生活一年讓他對新想法敞開了心胸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"狹隘"},{"w":"monolithic","pos":"adj.","def":"large and all the same, without variety","cn":"單一龐大的；鐵板一塊的","s":"English is not a ________ language, because people in Scotland, India and Jamaica all speak it in very different ways.","zh":"英文並不是單一不變的語言，因為蘇格蘭、印度和牙買加的人說英文的方式都非常不同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"單一不變的"},{"w":"pluralistic","pos":"adj.","def":"accepting many different groups and views","cn":"多元的","s":"Taiwan is becoming more ________, so public announcements on the MRT are now made in four different languages.","zh":"台灣正變得更加多元，所以捷運上的公共廣播現在用四種不同的語言播報。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"多元"},{"w":"accede","pos":"v.","def":"to agree to a request","cn":"同意；應允","s":"The school ________ to the parents' request, so Japanese is now offered as an after-school class.","zh":"學校同意了家長的請求，所以現在日文被列為課後課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"同意"},{"w":"adjudicate","pos":"v.","def":"to judge officially","cn":"裁決；評判","s":"Three teachers ________ the English speech contest, and they gave marks for content, pronunciation and confidence.","zh":"三位老師評判這場英文演講比賽，而他們針對內容、發音和自信心給分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"評判"},{"w":"append","pos":"v.","def":"to add something at the end","cn":"附加","s":"Please ________ a short glossary to your report, so readers can check the technical terms quickly.","zh":"請在你的報告後附加一份簡短的詞彙表，好讓讀者能快速查閱專業術語。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"附加"},{"w":"apprise","pos":"v.","def":"to inform someone","cn":"告知；通知","s":"The airline ________ passengers of the delay in three languages, but many people still missed the announcement.","zh":"航空公司用三種語言通知乘客班機延誤，但許多人仍錯過了廣播。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"通知"},{"w":"berate","pos":"v.","def":"to scold someone angrily","cn":"嚴厲斥責","s":"The coach ________ the players for their careless mistakes, but later he apologised for shouting so loudly.","zh":"教練嚴厲斥責球員們粗心的失誤，但後來他為大聲吼叫道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"嚴厲斥責"},{"w":"cajole","pos":"v.","def":"to persuade someone with gentle words","cn":"哄騙；勸誘","s":"My mum ________ my little brother into reading an English book, because she promised him ice cream afterwards.","zh":"我媽媽哄我弟弟讀一本英文書，因為她答應他之後給他冰淇淋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"哄"},{"w":"codify","pos":"v.","def":"to arrange rules into a written system","cn":"編纂；系統化","s":"Early dictionary makers tried to ________ English spelling, but many strange spellings were already too common to change.","zh":"早期的字典編纂者試圖把英文拼字系統化，但許多奇怪的拼法已經太普遍而無法改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"系統化"},{"w":"demur","pos":"v.","def":"to show you don't agree","cn":"表示異議；猶豫","s":"The manager suggested working on Sunday, but several staff ________, so the meeting was moved to Monday.","zh":"經理建議星期天加班，但好幾位員工表示異議，所以會議改到星期一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"表示異議"},{"w":"deprecate","pos":"v.","def":"to express disapproval of something","cn":"不贊成；反對","s":"Some teachers ________ the use of translation apps in class, but others think they can be useful if used carefully.","zh":"有些老師不贊成在課堂上使用翻譯應用程式，但其他老師認為若謹慎使用會很有用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"不贊成"},{"w":"explicate","pos":"v.","def":"to explain something in detail","cn":"詳細解釋","s":"The professor took an hour to ________ one short poem, and she showed us how every word carried hidden meaning.","zh":"教授花了一小時詳細解釋一首短詩，而她讓我們看到每個字如何承載隱藏的意思。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"詳細解釋"},{"w":"imbue","pos":"v.","def":"to fill with a feeling or quality","cn":"使充滿；灌輸","s":"Her grandparents ________ her with a love of Taiwanese folk songs, so she now sings them at local festivals.","zh":"她的祖父母讓她充滿對台灣民謠的熱愛，所以她現在會在地方節慶中演唱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"充滿"},{"w":"implore","pos":"v.","def":"to ask someone desperately","cn":"懇求；哀求","s":"The lost tourist ________ us to help him find his hotel, so we called the front desk and explained in Chinese.","zh":"那位迷路的觀光客懇求我們幫他找飯店，所以我們打給櫃台並用中文說明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"懇求"},{"w":"inculcate","pos":"v.","def":"to teach an idea by repeating it often","cn":"反覆灌輸","s":"Good teachers ________ a habit of reading every day, because regular reading builds vocabulary better than lists.","zh":"好老師會反覆灌輸每天閱讀的習慣，因為規律閱讀比背單字表更能增加詞彙量。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"反覆灌輸"},{"w":"intersperse","pos":"v.","def":"to put things here and there among other things","cn":"點綴；散布","s":"The speaker ________ her talk with funny stories, so the audience stayed interested for the whole hour.","zh":"講者在演講中穿插好笑的故事，所以觀眾整整一小時都保持興趣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"穿插"},{"w":"liaise","pos":"v.","def":"to work with and share information with others","cn":"聯絡；協調","s":"The translator will ________ with the Japanese team, so our manager does not need to send emails in Japanese.","zh":"譯者將與日本團隊聯絡協調，所以我們經理不需要用日文寄電子郵件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"聯絡協調"},{"w":"mollify","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone less angry","cn":"平息；安撫","s":"The waiter tried to ________ the angry customer with a free dessert, and he apologised in careful English.","zh":"服務生試著用一份免費甜點安撫那位生氣的顧客，並用謹慎的英文道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"安撫"},{"w":"obviate","pos":"v.","def":"to remove the need for something","cn":"免除；使不必要","s":"Clear instructions ________ the need for long explanations, so the workers can start the task right away.","zh":"清楚的說明能免除冗長解釋的需要，所以工人能立刻開始工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"免除"},{"w":"promulgate","pos":"v.","def":"to make an idea or law widely known","cn":"頒布；宣傳推廣","s":"The ministry ________ a new spelling guide for schools, and teachers had to learn the changes over the summer.","zh":"教育部頒布了一份新的學校拼寫指南，而老師們必須在暑假學會這些改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"頒布"},{"w":"prevaricate","pos":"v.","def":"to avoid giving a direct answer","cn":"支吾搪塞","s":"When the reporter asked about the error, the spokesman began to ________, so everyone suspected he was hiding something.","zh":"當記者問到那個錯誤時，發言人開始支吾其詞，所以大家懷疑他在隱瞞什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"支吾其詞"},{"w":"transpose","pos":"v.","def":"to change the order or position of things","cn":"調換；移調","s":"Learners sometimes ________ two letters when they type quickly, so \"form\" and \"from\" are a common mix-up.","zh":"學習者打字很快時有時會把兩個字母對調，所以「form」和「from」是常見的混淆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"對調"},{"w":"vacillate","pos":"v.","def":"to keep changing your mind","cn":"猶豫不決；搖擺不定","s":"I ________ between studying Spanish and Japanese for months, but in the end I chose Japanese because of anime.","zh":"我在學西班牙文和日文之間搖擺不定好幾個月，但最後因為動漫選了日文。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"搖擺不定"},{"w":"vex","pos":"v.","def":"to annoy or worry someone","cn":"使煩惱；使惱火","s":"English spelling continues to ________ students, because so many words are not written the way they sound.","zh":"英文拼字持續困擾學生，因為許多字的寫法和發音不一樣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"困擾"},{"w":"antagonise","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone angry or unfriendly","cn":"激怒；使對立","s":"Try not to ________ your teammates by correcting their English in front of everyone, because it can be embarrassing.","zh":"試著不要在大家面前糾正隊友的英文而激怒他們，因為那可能令人難堪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"激怒"},{"w":"atone","pos":"v.","def":"to do something to make up for a wrong","cn":"贖罪；彌補","s":"He wanted to ________ for his rude comments, so he wrote a long apology to his host family in their language.","zh":"他想彌補自己無禮的言論，所以他用寄宿家庭的語言寫了一封長長的道歉信。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"彌補"},{"w":"circumscribe","pos":"v.","def":"to limit something","cn":"限制","s":"The new rules ________ the use of phones during class, but students may still use dictionaries on them.","zh":"新規定限制課堂上使用手機，但學生仍可用手機查字典。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"限制"},{"w":"gainsay","pos":"v.","def":"to deny or disagree with something","cn":"否認；反駁","s":"Nobody can ________ the value of reading, but many students still prefer watching short videos.","zh":"沒有人能否認閱讀的價值，但許多學生仍偏好看短影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"否認"},{"w":"rephrase","pos":"v.","def":"to say something again using different words","cn":"換個說法","s":"If the examiner does not understand you, ________ your idea in simpler words, and keep talking calmly.","zh":"如果考官聽不懂你的話，就用更簡單的字換個說法，並保持冷靜繼續說。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"換個說法"},{"w":"reword","pos":"v.","def":"to change the words of a text","cn":"改寫措辭","s":"The company had to ________ its new advertisement, because the direct translation sounded quite rude to customers in Spanish.","zh":"這家公司必須改寫新廣告的措辭，因為直接翻譯成西班牙文後對顧客來說聽起來相當無禮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"改寫"},{"w":"interchangeably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that one can replace the other","cn":"可互換地","s":"People often use \"big\" and \"large\" ________, but we say \"a big mistake\" much more often than \"a large mistake\".","zh":"人們常常互換使用「big」和「large」，但我們說「a big mistake」比「a large mistake」頻繁得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"互換使用"},{"w":"expressly","pos":"adv.","def":"clearly and on purpose","cn":"明確地；特意地","s":"The exam rules ________ say that phones are not allowed, so the student who used one received a zero.","zh":"考試規則明確規定不得使用手機，所以那名使用手機的學生得了零分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"明確"},{"w":"loosely","pos":"adv.","def":"not exactly","cn":"大致地；不嚴格地","s":"The film is ________ based on a true story, so many events and characters were changed for the screen.","zh":"這部電影是大致根據真實故事改編的，所以許多事件和角色都為了銀幕而改動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"大致"},{"w":"strictly","pos":"adv.","def":"exactly and completely","cn":"嚴格地","s":"________ speaking, a tomato is a fruit, but most people still put it in salads and call it a vegetable.","zh":"嚴格來說，番茄是一種水果，但大多數人仍然把它放進沙拉並稱它為蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"嚴格"},{"w":"clarification","pos":"n.","def":"an explanation that makes something clearer","cn":"澄清；說明","s":"If you don't understand a question in the interview, ask for ________, because guessing may lead to a wrong answer.","zh":"如果你在面試中聽不懂問題，就要求澄清，因為瞎猜可能導致錯誤的回答。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"澄清"},{"w":"relatable","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to understand because it is like your own life","cn":"能引起共鳴的","s":"The novel's teenage hero is very ________, so young readers in many countries see themselves in her problems.","zh":"這部小說的青少年主角非常能引起共鳴，所以許多國家的年輕讀者都在她的問題中看見自己。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"能引起共鳴"},{"w":"cadence","pos":"n.","def":"the rise and fall of the voice when speaking","cn":"抑揚頓挫；語調節奏","s":"The poet read with a gentle ________, so even listeners who did not know Welsh enjoyed the sound of her words.","zh":"詩人用柔和的抑揚頓挫朗讀，所以即使不懂威爾斯語的聽眾也很享受她話語的聲音。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"抑揚頓挫"},{"w":"gesticulate","pos":"v.","def":"to move your hands while talking","cn":"比手畫腳","s":"When we could not find the right words, we ________ wildly, and the market seller finally understood that we wanted mangoes.","zh":"當我們找不到適當的字時，就拼命比手畫腳，而市場攤販終於明白我們想要芒果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"比手畫腳"},{"w":"loquacious","pos":"adj.","def":"talking a lot","cn":"健談的；多話的","s":"My ________ neighbour talks to me in English every morning, so my speaking has improved without any classes.","zh":"我那位健談的鄰居每天早上都和我用英文聊天，所以我沒上任何課口說就進步了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"健談的"},{"w":"mellifluous","pos":"adj.","def":"sweet and smooth to hear","cn":"（聲音）甜美流暢的","s":"The radio host has a ________ voice, so many listeners say they feel calm while they drive to work.","zh":"那位廣播主持人有著甜美圓潤的嗓音，所以許多聽眾說他們開車上班時感覺很平靜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"甜美圓潤的"},{"w":"moribund","pos":"adj.","def":"close to dying or ending","cn":"垂死的；瀕臨消亡的","s":"The language was ________ by 1990, but a new school programme has brought hundreds of young speakers back.","zh":"這種語言到 1990 年時已瀕臨消亡，但一個新的學校計畫已帶回了數百名年輕使用者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"瀕臨消亡"},{"w":"pithy","pos":"adj.","def":"short but full of meaning","cn":"精闢的；簡潔有力的","s":"The teacher wrote a ________ comment on my essay, and those few words helped me more than a long report.","zh":"老師在我的作文上寫了一句精闢的評語，而那寥寥幾個字比長篇報告更能幫助我。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"精闢的"},{"w":"quip","pos":"n.","def":"a short, clever joke","cn":"妙語；俏皮話","s":"The interpreter could not translate the president's ________ about cheese, so she simply told the audience it was a joke.","zh":"口譯員無法翻譯總統關於起司的俏皮話，所以她只好告訴觀眾那是個笑話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"俏皮話"},{"w":"repartee","pos":"n.","def":"quick and clever replies in conversation","cn":"機智應答","s":"The two hosts are famous for their ________, but they say it took years of practice to sound so natural.","zh":"兩位主持人以機智的對答聞名，但他們說花了好幾年練習才能聽起來那麼自然。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"機智的對答"},{"w":"verbiage","pos":"n.","def":"too many unnecessary words","cn":"冗詞贅字","s":"Cut the ________ from your essay, because examiners prefer clear points to long sentences that say very little.","zh":"刪掉你文章中的冗詞贅字，因為考官偏好清楚的論點，而不是說了很少內容的長句。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"冗詞贅字"},{"w":"voluble","pos":"adj.","def":"talking a lot and quickly","cn":"健談的；滔滔不絕的","s":"The ________ tour guide explained every building in fast English, so we had to ask her to slow down.","zh":"那位滔滔不絕的導遊用很快的英文解說每棟建築，所以我們只好請她說慢一點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"滔滔不絕的"},{"w":"wry","pos":"adj.","def":"showing amused but slightly annoyed humour","cn":"苦笑的；挖苦的","s":"He gave a ________ smile when the app translated his name as \"fried egg\", but he still showed it to his friends.","zh":"當應用程式把他的名字翻成「煎蛋」時，他露出苦笑，但他還是拿給朋友看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"苦笑"},{"w":"peruse","pos":"v.","def":"to read something carefully","cn":"細讀；仔細閱讀","s":"Please ________ the contract before you sign it, because the English version and the Chinese version may differ.","zh":"簽約前請仔細閱讀合約，因為英文版和中文版可能有出入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"仔細閱讀"},{"w":"opine","pos":"v.","def":"to give your opinion","cn":"發表意見","s":"Many people ________ online about the \"correct\" way to speak, but linguists say every variety has its own rules.","zh":"許多人在網路上發表意見談論「正確」的說話方式，但語言學家說每種語言變體都有自己的規則。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"發表意見"},{"w":"pundit","pos":"n.","def":"an expert who gives opinions in the media","cn":"專家；評論員","s":"A TV ________ claimed that young people cannot write properly any more, but the research shows a different picture.","zh":"一位電視評論員聲稱年輕人已經不會好好寫作了，但研究呈現出不同的情況。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"評論員"},{"w":"germane","pos":"adj.","def":"relevant to the subject","cn":"密切相關的","s":"Your story about your holiday is interesting, but it is not ________ to the essay question, so please remove it.","zh":"你關於假期的故事很有趣，但和作文題目並不相關，所以請把它刪掉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"相關"},{"w":"flippant","pos":"adj.","def":"not serious when you should be","cn":"輕率的；不認真的","s":"His ________ answer about climate change annoyed the examiner, so he lost marks for not taking the topic seriously.","zh":"他對氣候變遷輕率的回答惹惱了考官，所以他因為沒有認真看待題目而被扣分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"輕率的"},{"w":"genial","pos":"adj.","def":"friendly and cheerful","cn":"親切友好的；和藹的","s":"The ________ old professor invited international students to his home, and he cooked dishes from each of their countries.","zh":"那位和藹的老教授邀請國際學生到他家，還煮了他們每個人國家的菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"和藹的"},{"w":"cordial","pos":"adj.","def":"warm and polite","cn":"熱誠的；誠懇的","s":"The two leaders had a ________ meeting, and their interpreters said the conversation went smoothly from start to finish.","zh":"兩位領袖進行了一場誠懇友好的會談，而他們的口譯員說對話從頭到尾都很順利。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"誠懇友好的"},{"w":"edify","pos":"v.","def":"to teach someone in a way that improves their mind","cn":"啟發；教誨","s":"The museum's language exhibition is designed to ________ visitors, but it is also full of fun games for children.","zh":"博物館的語言展旨在啟發參觀者，但它也充滿了給孩子玩的有趣遊戲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"啟發"},{"w":"epiphany","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden moment of understanding","cn":"頓悟","s":"I had an ________ when I realised that English \"the\" works a bit like pointing, and after that articles felt much easier.","zh":"當我明白英文的「the」有點像用手指東西時，我突然頓悟了，從那之後冠詞感覺容易多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"頓悟"},{"w":"exuberant","pos":"adj.","def":"full of energy and happiness","cn":"活力充沛的；熱情洋溢的","s":"The ________ children sang the English song loudly, and their parents filmed the performance on their phones.","zh":"那些活力充沛的孩子大聲唱著英文歌，而他們的父母用手機錄下了表演。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"活力充沛的"},{"w":"misgiving","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of doubt or worry","cn":"疑慮；擔憂","s":"I had some ________ about studying abroad alone, but the friendly people there soon made me feel at home.","zh":"我對獨自出國念書有些疑慮，但那裡友善的人們很快讓我感覺像在家一樣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"疑慮"},{"w":"qualm","pos":"n.","def":"an uneasy feeling that you are doing wrong","cn":"不安；顧慮","s":"She had no ________ about asking strangers for directions, so her French improved very quickly in Paris.","zh":"她對向陌生人問路毫無顧慮，所以她的法文在巴黎進步得非常快。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"顧慮"},{"w":"vehement","pos":"adj.","def":"showing strong feeling","cn":"激烈的；強烈的","s":"There was ________ opposition to closing the language centre, so hundreds of students signed a petition.","zh":"關閉語言中心遭到強烈的反對，所以有數百名學生連署請願。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"強烈的"},{"w":"unabashed","pos":"adj.","def":"not ashamed or embarrassed","cn":"毫不掩飾的；不害臊的","s":"He is an ________ fan of K-pop, and he proudly sings Korean songs at every school party.","zh":"他是一個毫不掩飾的 K-pop 迷，而且他在每場學校派對上都自豪地唱韓文歌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"毫不掩飾的"},{"w":"pensive","pos":"adj.","def":"thinking deeply, often a little sadly","cn":"沉思的","s":"She looked ________ as she read her grandfather's old letters, because she was trying to imagine his life in the 1950s.","zh":"她讀著爺爺的舊信時看起來若有所思，因為她正試著想像他在 1950 年代的生活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"若有所思"},{"w":"solemn","pos":"adj.","def":"serious and formal","cn":"莊嚴的；嚴肅的","s":"The ceremony was ________, so the students stood silently while the national anthem played in two languages.","zh":"典禮很莊嚴，所以學生們靜靜站立，國歌以兩種語言播放。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"莊嚴"},{"w":"camaraderie","pos":"n.","def":"friendship and trust among a group","cn":"友誼；同袍情誼","s":"There was real ________ in our language class, because we laughed at our mistakes together and helped each other study.","zh":"我們的語言班有真正的同儕情誼，因為我們一起笑看自己的錯誤，也互相幫助讀書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"同儕情誼"},{"w":"charisma","pos":"n.","def":"a strong personal charm that attracts people","cn":"領袖魅力；個人魅力","s":"The speaker had so much ________ that people listened to every word, even though her English was not perfect.","zh":"那位講者極具個人魅力，以致人們專心聽她說的每一個字，即使她的英文並不完美。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"個人魅力"},{"w":"lost for words","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"so surprised or moved that you cannot speak","cn":"驚訝得說不出話","s":"I was ______ ______ ______ when my students surprised me with a cake, so I just smiled and hugged them all.","zh":"當學生們用蛋糕給我驚喜時，我感動得說不出話，所以我只是微笑並擁抱了他們每一個人。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"感動得說不出話"},{"w":"in other words","pos":"phr.","def":"used to say something again more simply","cn":"換句話說","s":"The test is \"not compulsory\"; ______ ______ ______, you can choose not to take it, but most students take it anyway.","zh":"這個考試「並非強制」；換句話說，你可以選擇不考，但大多數學生還是會去考。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"換句話說"},{"w":"have a way with words","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be good at speaking or writing","cn":"很會說話；文筆好","s":"My sister ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so she always writes the birthday cards for our family.","zh":"我姊姊很會遣詞用字，所以我們家的生日卡片總是由她來寫。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"很會遣詞用字"},{"w":"not mince one's words","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to speak very directly, even if it is unkind","cn":"說話直截了當","s":"My coach does ______ ______ ______ ______, so when I play badly he tells me exactly what I did wrong.","zh":"我的教練說話直截了當，所以當我表現不好時，他會確切告訴我哪裡做錯了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"說話直截了當"},{"w":"have the last word","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make the final comment in an argument","cn":"說最後一句話","s":"My little brother always wants to ______ ______ ______ ______, so our arguments go on until Mum tells us to stop.","zh":"我弟弟總是想說最後一句話，所以我們的爭吵會一直持續到媽媽叫我們停止為止。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"說最後一句話"},{"w":"word for word","pos":"adv.","def":"in exactly the same words","cn":"一字不差地；逐字地","s":"Don't copy the article ______ ______ ______, because your teacher wants you to explain the ideas in your own words.","zh":"不要逐字照抄那篇文章，因為老師希望你用自己的話來解釋這些想法。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"逐字"},{"w":"it's all Greek to me","pos":"phr.","def":"I cannot understand this at all","cn":"我完全看不懂","s":"My dad showed me his tax forms, but ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so I told him to ask an accountant.","zh":"我爸爸給我看他的報稅表，但我完全看不懂，所以我叫他去問會計師。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"我完全看不懂"},{"w":"speak the same language","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to share similar ideas and understand each other","cn":"想法一致；有共同語言","s":"The designer and the engineer finally ______ ______ ______ ______, so the project moved much faster after that meeting.","zh":"設計師和工程師終於有了共同語言，所以那次會議之後計畫進展得快多了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"有了共同語言"},{"w":"the gift of the gab","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the ability to speak easily and persuasively","cn":"好口才","s":"Our class president has ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so she can talk the teachers into almost anything.","zh":"我們班長有好口才，所以她幾乎可以說服老師答應任何事。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"好口才"},{"w":"tongue-tied","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to speak because you are nervous","cn":"緊張得說不出話","s":"I was ________ when I met my favourite singer, so I just stood there and forgot every English word I knew.","zh":"當我見到最喜歡的歌手時，我緊張得說不出話，所以我只是站在那裡，忘光了我會的每一個英文字。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"緊張得說不出話"},{"w":"a slip of the tongue","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small mistake when you are speaking","cn":"口誤","s":"Calling my teacher \"Mum\" was ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but the whole class laughed for five minutes.","zh":"叫老師「媽媽」只是一個口誤，但全班笑了五分鐘。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"口誤"},{"w":"bite one's tongue","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to stop yourself from saying something","cn":"忍住不說","s":"I wanted to correct my boss's English, but I ______ ______ ______, because the meeting was not the right time.","zh":"我想糾正老闆的英文，但我忍住沒說，因為會議中不是適當的時機。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"忍住沒說"},{"w":"mind one's language","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be careful not to use rude words","cn":"說話注意用詞","s":"Please ______ ______ ______ in front of the children, because they copy every word they hear.","zh":"請在孩子面前注意你的用詞，因為他們會模仿聽到的每一個字。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"注意你的用詞"},{"w":"pick up a language","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to learn a language naturally without formal study","cn":"自然學會一種語言","s":"Young kids can ______ ______ ______ ______ quickly when they play with local children, while adults often need classes.","zh":"小孩和當地孩子一起玩時能很快地自然學會一種語言，而大人常常需要上課。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"自然學會一種語言"},{"w":"get by in","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to know just enough of a language to manage","cn":"勉強應付（某語言）","s":"I can ______ ______ ______ Japanese when I travel, but I cannot understand the news or have deep conversations.","zh":"我旅行時能用日文勉強應付，但我聽不懂新聞，也無法深入交談。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"勉強應付"},{"w":"break the ice","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make people feel relaxed when they first meet","cn":"打破僵局；破冰","s":"Our teacher played a name game to ______ ______ ______ on the first day, and soon everyone was chatting and laughing.","zh":"老師在第一天玩了一個名字遊戲來破冰，很快大家就聊天說笑起來了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"破冰"},{"w":"talk at cross purposes","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to misunderstand each other because you mean different things","cn":"雞同鴨講","s":"We ______ ______ ______ ______ for ten minutes, because I meant the train station while she meant the bus station.","zh":"我們雞同鴨講了十分鐘，因為我指的是火車站，而她指的是公車站。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"雞同鴨講"},{"w":"actions speak louder than words","pos":"phr.","def":"what you do matters more than what you say","cn":"行動勝於言語","s":"He promised to practise English every day, but ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so I'll believe it when I see it.","zh":"他答應每天練習英文，但行動勝於言語，所以等我親眼看到才會相信。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"行動勝於言語"},{"w":"put words into someone's mouth","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to say that someone said something they did not","cn":"曲解別人的話；硬說別人說過","s":"Please don't ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because I never said that your translation was bad.","zh":"請不要硬說我說過那些話，因為我從來沒說你的翻譯很糟。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"硬說我說過那些話"},{"w":"speak volumes","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to show something clearly without words","cn":"說明一切；意味深長","s":"Her silence ______ ______ after the argument, so I knew I had to apologise before dinner.","zh":"爭吵後她的沉默說明了一切，所以我知道我必須在晚餐前道歉。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"說明了一切"}]};
